Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.69,0:02:11.94,Note,0,0,0,0,,（马来西亚东）
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.95,0:03:46.51,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎光临婆罗洲森林保护区）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.34,0:04:27.49,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生命基金会）
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.39,0:04:41.56,Title,0,0,0,0,,《毒液：致命守护者》
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.01,0:04:49.06,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山 加州）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.55,0:10:20.72,Note,0,0,0,0,,（李·塔林来信）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.35,0:10:28.98,Note,0,0,0,0,,（安妮·韦英）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.81,0:10:34.65,Note,0,0,0,0,,（附件为审查所需的案例摘要 如果有其他需要请告知 谢谢）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.74,0:10:38.86,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生命基金会法律备忘录）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.24,0:10:48.33,Note,0,0,0,0,,（过失致死诉讼）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.13,0:10:54.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（参与第三阶段用基因疗法治疗晚期胰腺癌的实验对象为）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.13,0:10:55.13,Note,0,0,0,0,,（萨拉·钱伯斯、菲利普·巴克利、罗伯特·麦克唐纳）
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.13,0:10:55.84,Note,0,0,0,0,,（生命基金会政策： 不上报）
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.49,0:17:40.87,Note,0,0,0,0,,（六个月后）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.12,0:23:03.40,Note,0,0,0,0,,（逾期未还款通知）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.29,0:23:15.41,Note,0,0,0,0,,（- 嘿 老兄 你那儿有什么我可以干的活吗 - 抱歉 埃迪 我目前帮不上你）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.45,0:23:17.00,Note,0,0,0,0,,（招聘洗碗工）
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.68,0:23:24.43,Title,0,0,0,0,,（艾克哈特·托尔 《新世界：灵性的觉醒》）
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.08,0:33:09.25,Note,0,0,0,0,,（朵拉·斯克斯博士）
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.59,0:36:04.64,Note,0,0,0,0,,（状态稳定 已寄生四天）
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.26,0:37:24.56,Note,0,0,0,0,,（警告 禁区）
Dialogue: 0,0:42:22.22,0:42:25.39,Note,0,0,0,0,,（- 发生什么了 回我电话 - 我没事 待会打给你 注意安全）
Dialogue: 0,1:01:04.13,1:01:07.05,Note,0,0,0,0,,（旧金山国际机场）
Dialogue: 0,1:05:16.85,1:05:20.12,Note,0,0,0,0,,（做正确的事 混蛋）
Dialogue: 0,1:20:29.88,1:20:31.80,Note,0,0,0,0,,（中止协议 紧急制动）
Dialogue: 0,1:34:17.75,1:34:21.34,Note,0,0,0,0,,（圣昆廷监狱））
Dialogue: 0,1:35:19.77,1:35:22.69,Note,0,0,0,0,,（欢迎你 埃迪）
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.85,0:16:35.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他妈的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.04,0:16:37.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你神经病啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you crazy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.66,0:16:55.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:30.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命一号呼叫基金会控制中心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life Foundation Control, this is LF1.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.71,0:01:33.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,样本已采集完毕 正在返航\N{\fnArial\fs30}The specimens are secured, and we're heading home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.35,0:01:35.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 生命一号 准备重返大气层\N{\fnArial\fs30}Roger, LF1. You are a go for reentry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.79,0:01:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 启动重返大气层程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that. Initiating reentry sequence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.68,0:01:40.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,坐标零点四 一零三点…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Point-four by 103-point…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.98,0:01:42.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,糟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.36,0:01:43.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关上 把它关起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seal it off. Seal it off!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:45.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,呼叫生命一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}LF1, Mission Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.28,0:01:47.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,信号不稳定 请回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're breaking up. Please repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.13,0:01:48.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求救 求救 - 生命一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mayday, Mayday - LF1!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求救 - 呼叫生命一号\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mayday! - LF1, Mission Control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.75,0:01:52.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,请回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.61,0:01:55.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,控制中心呼叫生命一号 请回复\N{\fnArial\fs30}LF1, Mission Control. Please repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.29,0:02:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,现场整理完后才可以拿到报告 我可等不了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to have to wait for full clean-up just to get a status report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.88,0:02:49.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们已经在尽快采集现场数据了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're collecting this data as quickly as possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.18,0:02:50.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不够快\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not good enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.23,0:02:51.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 你来告诉我到底怎么回事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, maybe you can tell me what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.77,0:02:52.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船上有一道裂痕\N{\fnArial\fs30}There was some kind of breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:55.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一位宇航员发出了求救信号\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the astronauts sent a distress call.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.14,0:02:57.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 船上人员情况呢 - 我们还在调查\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What about the crew? - We're still investigating.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.11,0:02:59.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞船坠毁在哪里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did it go down?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.51,0:03:01.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,在泗务以西二十公里处\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's 20 kilometers west of Sibu.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.53,0:03:03.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那至少所有的样本都找回来了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did we at least retrieve all of the samples?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.81,0:03:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,没有 我们只找到了其中三个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We have three of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.58,0:03:07.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,有一个机体样本逃出了容器\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the organisms got out of containment, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.81,0:03:10.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,目前下落不明 我们尚不清楚是哪一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's missing. We don't know which one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.58,0:03:25.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,她在说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is she saying?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.84,0:03:27.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,其中一个宇航员还活着\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of the astronauts is still alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.74,0:03:34.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是詹姆森\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's Jameson.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.03,0:05:00.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 早上好 帅哥 - 干什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Morning, sunshine. - What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.36,0:05:01.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我醒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm awake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.91,0:05:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,没打中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Missed me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.21,0:05:05.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我醒了 - 给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm awake. - Here you go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.39,0:05:07.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你可以把它拿回去了 - 谢谢…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You can have it back. - Thank…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.79,0:05:11.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,你今天穿了西装 太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow, you're wearing a suit. Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我就喜欢你穿西装的样子 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I love it when you wear the suit. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.59,0:05:15.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天要去参加生命基金会案子的会议\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have depositions today in the Life Foundation case.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.00,0:05:18.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得给我讲讲会开得怎样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, let me know how your meeting goes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.16,0:05:19.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要开会吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}My meeting?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.49,0:05:21.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,见鬼 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.66,0:05:23.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我今天有会\N{\fnArial\fs30}My meeting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的咖啡\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coffee.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.17,0:05:31.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你真好 - 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are perfect. - Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.96,0:05:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得今天晚上有什么安排吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, you know what… You know what night it is tonight, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.72,0:05:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,约会之夜\N{\fnArial\fs30}Date night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.12,0:05:38.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 我大约六点左右去接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I will pick you up around, uh, 6:00.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.64,0:05:41.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,别忘了戴上你的头盔\N{\fnArial\fs30}And please do not forget your helmet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,真高兴你喜欢它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I'm glad that you like it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.57,0:05:44.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还打算在婚礼上戴着它呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I plan on wearing it at our wedding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.79,0:05:46.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,那可太性感了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's hot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.77,0:05:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,记得喂猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Feed the cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.17,0:05:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,放心吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.36,0:05:50.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I love you!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.46,0:05:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也爱你 记得喂猫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Love you, too. Feed the cat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.79,0:06:13.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪·布洛克现场报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock with boots on the ground{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.58,0:06:15.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天在教会区追踪一条线索…\N{\fnArial\fs30}today in the Mission District, chasing a lead into some…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.49,0:06:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,大家都知道硅谷是如何管理谷歌和脸书的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody knows how our Silicon Valley overlords at Google and Facebook…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.46,0:06:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,上次 我去调查了一下 问了一些让人不太舒服的问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Last time, I was poking around asking uncomfortable questions…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.95,0:06:24.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,无家可归的人越来越多 已经成千上万…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Homelessness is only increasing into the thousands…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.54,0:06:27.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪·布洛克在奥兰克市中心为大家进行报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock here reporting today from downtown Oakland, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.35,0:06:30.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,这里发生了大规模的街头示威游行\N{\fnArial\fs30}where massive demonstrations have taken over the streets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.20,0:06:34.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经追查这起房地产贿赂案好几个星期了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've been chasing this real-estate bribery story for a few weeks now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.14,0:06:36.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你听了一定会很生气 由于全副武装…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is gonna piss you off. …all being strong-armed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.81,0:06:39.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,鉴于尸体的状况\N{\fnArial\fs30}Medical examiner has yet to determine cause of death, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.23,0:06:40.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,法医尚未确定死因\N{\fnArial\fs30}due to the condition of the body, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.63,0:06:44.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你不会因为天气原因就被埋在垃圾场底部\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you don't wind up at the bottom of a landfill due to natural causes, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.60,0:06:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 看来这座城市\N{\fnArial\fs30}so it seems that the city{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.96,0:06:50.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,也不比凶手们更关心这些人\N{\fnArial\fs30}doesn't care about these people any more than the killer does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.40,0:06:53.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是埃迪·布洛克 这里是布洛克报道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Eddie Brock, and this is The Brock Report.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.28,0:06:54.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 理查德\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Richard!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.81,0:06:55.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,气色不错啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Looking good!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.68,0:06:57.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你不能把车停那里 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you can't park there, bro.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.62,0:07:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,拜托 老兄 凡事皆可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on, man. There's no such thing as can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.16,0:07:01.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你女儿怎么样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}How'd she do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.07,0:07:04.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,伯克利 布朗 麻省理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}Berkeley. Brown. MIT.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.14,0:07:06.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 都给了她奖学金 - 我说什么来着\N{\fnArial\fs30}- She's got a scholarship, bro. - What'd I tell you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.51,0:07:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You told me what?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.53,0:07:09.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 凡事皆可能 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No such thing as can't. - Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.85,0:07:11.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的车\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bike.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.97,0:07:13.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻省理工\N{\fnArial\fs30}MIT! Whoo!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.85,0:07:18.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道我最爱这片景色的哪一点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what I love about this view?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.65,0:07:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是永远都看不腻\N{\fnArial\fs30}It never gets old.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.32,0:07:21.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 这个嘛…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.37,0:07:24.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有点恐高\N{\fnArial\fs30}Height's not really my thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.46,0:07:26.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,但 这次是什么任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, uh… What's the deal?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.04,0:07:29.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我给你找了个大人物 独家专访 - 是吗 谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I got you the big one, exclusive. - Yeah? Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.43,0:07:30.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔顿·德雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlton Drake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.81,0:07:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔顿·德雷克 - 这个人很有远见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlton Drake? - The man's a visionary.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.98,0:07:34.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他想谈谈关于火箭的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wants to talk about his rockets, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.91,0:07:37.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,让大家相信火箭很安全 那场坠毁只是个意外\N{\fnArial\fs30}assure everyone they're safe, that the crash was an anomaly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.31,0:07:41.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,那他可真是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's… He's seriously off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.76,0:07:43.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我跟你直说吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna level with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.25,0:07:45.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,只要卡尔顿·德雷克愿意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlton Drake could buy us with his pocket cash, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.00,0:07:48.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,他能用自己的零钱买下这栋楼当他的车库\N{\fnArial\fs30}turn this building into his own garage if he so wished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.80,0:07:51.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 你只需要去问他几个关于太空项目的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you're just gonna ask him about his space program, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.59,0:07:54.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢他一下 祝他度过愉快的一天就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're gonna thank him, and you're gonna bid him a nice day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.26,0:07:57.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,他是个骗子\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a crook.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.47,0:08:02.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 当你无家可归的时候 是我们接纳了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, when you had nowhere to go, we gave you a home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.48,0:08:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,而现在 你知道大家有多爱看你的节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, you know we love the Eddie Brock show.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.49,0:08:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是当下最好的调查记者\N{\fnArial\fs30}There isn't a better investigative reporter working today, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.20,0:08:09.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是说到底 你也只是个员工\N{\fnArial\fs30}but no one is above the network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.06,0:08:12.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,就当帮我个忙 埃迪 别再刨根问底了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So do me a favor, Eddie, don't start your shit again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.65,0:08:13.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.17,0:08:16.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 就当为了我 - 好 我去就是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- For me. - All right. I'll do it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.07,0:08:19.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道他为什么要给我这个任务 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know why he gave me this assignment, Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不这么做节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not… It's not what I do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.61,0:08:22.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈妈常常对我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, my mother always told me{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.79,0:08:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,生命中任何值得拥有的东西 都需要牺牲…\N{\fnArial\fs30}that anything in life worth having would take sacrifice…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.64,0:08:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,耐心…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patience…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.50,0:08:30.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有努力的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}And be a lot of work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.04,0:08:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就是你\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:32.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不是 - 我就是在说你值得拥有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's not. - …that I'm talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.91,0:08:33.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nah. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.06,0:08:35.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,遇见我是你的幸运\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you're lucky to have me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.36,0:08:37.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,老实说 我很抢手\N{\fnArial\fs30}To be fair, I'm quite a catch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.61,0:08:39.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我妈是这么跟我说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what my mom told me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.38,0:08:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那你明天会乖乖的吗 - 不会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you gonna behave yourself tomorrow? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.26,0:08:45.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我要做好我的工作 这才是我要做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm gonna do my job. That's what I'm gonna do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.15,0:08:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能…不做好我的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't, you know, not do my job.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.33,0:08:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们那个老板就是个…\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guy you work for is a complete…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.56,0:08:51.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不为德雷克工作 我为我的律所工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't work for Drake. I work for my firm, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.46,0:08:52.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的律所为他服务\N{\fnArial\fs30}and my firm works for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.71,0:08:55.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我相信 我们律所为很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm sure that they defend many people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.29,0:08:58.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认为不值得的人辩护 但我们不能重蹈覆辙\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you don't deem worthy, but we don't want a repeat.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.35,0:09:00.99,Title,0,0,0,0,,- 重蹈覆辙 - 《环球日报》事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}- A repeat? - Of the Daily Globe incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.68,0:09:02.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你认真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.64,0:09:04.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,事故吗 那才不是事故\N{\fnArial\fs30}Incident? That's not an incident.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.71,0:09:06.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 你被赶出纽约了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Baby, you were run out of New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.08,0:09:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没有 - 我不想你再离开旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I was not. I did not. - I don't want you run out of San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.61,0:09:09.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我在纽约还有声望呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I still have currency in New York.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.87,0:09:12.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是换了个地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was going places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.05,0:09:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是逃走 我去过不少地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wasn't running. I was going places.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.49,0:09:17.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,事实上 我是为了你才搬到旧金山的\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, I moved to San Francisco for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.25,0:09:19.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 为我吗 - 你就是我的家\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Me? - You are my home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.11,0:09:22.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,你一个人过也没那么糟糕 亲爱的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not so bad yourself, champ.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.46,0:09:28.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 少说话 多吻我 - 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Less talking, more kissing. - All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:29.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,让我先去把账结了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's just get the check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.92,0:09:59.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去喝点东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get a drink.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.58,0:11:03.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,很快 生命基金会将发射另一支火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Very soon, another Life Foundation rocket{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.62,0:11:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,去执行探索任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}will be sent on an exploratory mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.87,0:11:09.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,由此 终有一天 也许我们都能在太空居住\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that's how, one day, we might all live in space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.12,0:11:11.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cool, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.30,0:11:13.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经向大家展示了 我们正在做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now that I've shown you some of the cool stuff that we do here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.05,0:11:17.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望这些能激励你们每一个人 走出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hoping I've inspired each and every one of you to go out there{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,并且创造出他人只能梦想之物\N{\fnArial\fs30}and create things that others have only dreamt of{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.02,0:11:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Drake?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.64,0:11:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 别阻止她\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay. Don't silence her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.80,0:11:25.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来 你叫什么名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here. What's your name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:27.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.33,0:11:28.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,没关系 阿莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay, Allie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.18,0:11:30.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要知道 有时人们就是会这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, sometimes that's what people do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.25,0:11:32.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们总想让那些提出质疑的人闭上嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}They try and silence those of us who ask questions.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.72,0:11:34.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你知道吗 到最后\N{\fnArial\fs30}But you know what? In the end, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.71,0:11:37.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是改变世界的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}we're the ones who change the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.51,0:11:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,好好保管它 阿莉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take good care of that, Allie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.51,0:11:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,大伙 这位是斯克斯博士 打个招呼吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, this is Dr. Skirth. Say hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.72,0:11:43.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.76,0:11:45.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们好 孩子们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello, kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.28,0:11:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉打扰你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Um, sorry to interrupt, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.60,0:11:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过你该去换衣服接受采访了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it's time to get changed for your interview.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.91,0:11:51.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 孩子们 抱歉失陪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Uh, kids, sorry to leave you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.30,0:11:53.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,阿莉 现在你说了算 来击个掌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Allie, you're in charge. High five up top.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.40,0:11:56.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克斯博士会回答阿莉和其他人的问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Skirth will answer Allie's question, and any others.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.62,0:11:58.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 下次见 孩子们 再见 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- See you next time, guys. Bye! - Bye!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.48,0:12:00.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,你觉得呢 德雷克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you say, Mr. Drake, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.64,0:12:02.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们就从头开始聊吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}we just start at the beginning?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的父母是英国人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Born to British parents.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.30,0:12:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,在十九岁的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then at 19, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.30,0:12:08.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你发现了一种基因疗法\N{\fnArial\fs30}you discovered a gene therapy{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.02,0:12:12.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,差不多把胰腺癌患者的预期寿命延长了一倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}that literally doubles the life expectancy of pancreatic cancer patients.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.17,0:12:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上是延长了两倍\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, actually, it tripled their life expectancy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.85,0:12:16.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it's okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.22,0:12:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 二十四岁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, um, 24.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.08,0:12:19.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,那时还非常年轻\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's still extremely young.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.43,0:12:21.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就建立了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, you create{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.12,0:12:23.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 整个生命基金会 - 它并不是一夜之间成立的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- the Life Foundation! - It didn't happen overnight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.28,0:12:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后是…火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then… Rockets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.75,0:12:26.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你很快决定 就和所有普通人想的一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}You then decide, like any normal human being, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.04,0:12:28.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去探索太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're gonna go and explore space.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.02,0:12:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗 我一直都相信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what it is? I have always believed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.36,0:12:32.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,探索太空\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that space exploration{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.79,0:12:34.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,是寻求解决地球上所有\N{\fnArial\fs30}is crucial in our quest to cure{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,困扰我们的问题的关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}everything that ails us here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.57,0:12:38.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想想我们在海洋和陆地上…\N{\fnArial\fs30}But if you think about everything we've found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.27,0:12:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,所发现的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in the oceans and on land, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.42,0:12:41.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,难道现在不该抬头看看吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}isn't it time to look up there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.37,0:12:43.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,去看看那些无法计量的待开发资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}To this plethora of untapped resources?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.64,0:12:45.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的制药公司也有很多\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you have a plethora of untapped resources, also, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.45,0:12:47.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,无法计量的待开发资源\N{\fnArial\fs30}from your pharmaceutical companies{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:48.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你参与其中 它们使你意识到自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}that you're involved with, you know, to help you realize{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.03,0:12:50.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有探索太空的野心 我猜 - 当然\N{\fnArial\fs30}- that ambition, I suppose. - Of course.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.25,0:12:51.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 是个循环\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Full circle.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.36,0:12:53.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 我要问一下 它到底是怎么运营的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, I have to ask, how does that work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.83,0:12:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 整个生命基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}you know, exactly, the Life Foundation thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.49,0:12:57.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,它到底…到底是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}How does it… How does it, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.08,0:12:59.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就直说吧 它是如何进行\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know, how does it go about, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:01.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,药物试验的\N{\fnArial\fs30}say, testing pharmaceuticals?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.16,0:13:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 我们现在讨论的是火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, we're talking about the rocket here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:03.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not. I'm not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.90,0:13:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我更想谈谈对贵公司的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about the allegations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.58,0:13:07.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 我不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, I don't…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.59,0:13:10.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,据说 您的整个商业帝国是建立在\N{\fnArial\fs30}It says that your entire empire has been built{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.12,0:13:11.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 尸体之上的 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- on dead bodies. - Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.52,0:13:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是事实 对吧 据说你们招募\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's true, right? It says that you recruit{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.84,0:13:16.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,那些流浪汉 来做…\N{\fnArial\fs30}the most vulnerable of us to volunteer for tests…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.36,0:13:18.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,一些往往会致命的实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}…that more often than not end up killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.87,0:13:20.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 我知道网上有这样的谣言\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm aware of these rumors online.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.37,0:13:21.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 现在外面假新闻的确太多了 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- There's a lot of fake news out there these days. - Right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.91,0:13:23.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那已经立案的那些呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about the legal cases?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.52,0:13:24.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:27.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是已经成案的 比如萨拉·钱伯斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the actual legal cases, like Sarah Chambers, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.40,0:13:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 菲尔·巴克利 罗伯特·麦克唐纳 - 够了 时间到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Phil Barclay, Rob MacDonald. - That's it. Time to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.52,0:13:31.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢您来采访我 布洛克先生 - 而他们只是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you so much for coming to talk to me, Mr. Brock. - And they're just some of the people who walked{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.99,0:13:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 进了这扇门… - 祝您有愉快的一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}- through these doors… - Have a nice day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.94,0:13:34.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 请关掉摄像机 - 谢谢您\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Cut the camera off, please. - Thank you very much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.63,0:13:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 时间到了 走吧 - 他们就都死了…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Time is up. Come on. - They're dead. The Dead…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.70,0:13:36.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你能带他出去吗 - 这是死亡…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Could you show him out, please? - The Dead Found…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.59,0:13:38.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,别碰我 这是死亡基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't touch me. The Dead Foundation thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.39,0:13:39.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 出去 布洛克 - 我们还没聊完呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Get out of here, Brock. - We're not finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.69,0:13:41.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你完了 布洛克先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are, Mr. Brock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.19,0:13:42.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是在威胁我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that a threat?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.15,0:13:44.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝您生活愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.58,0:13:50.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道你要说什么 但是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know what you're going to say, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.19,0:13:53.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,这家伙坏透了 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}This guy, he is all the way bad, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.37,0:13:55.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你只要给我… - 消息哪儿来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- If you just give… - Who's your source?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.87,0:13:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 你的线人是谁 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Excuse me? - Who's your source, Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.36,0:14:04.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有线人 但我相信直觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have a source, per se. But I have a hunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.88,0:14:06.67,Title,0,0,0,0,,这不是在拍《狂野西部》\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't the Wild Wild West.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.87,0:14:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不凭直觉做事\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't go off half-cocked based on a hunch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.87,0:14:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do the work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.52,0:14:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,需要证实我们的指控\N{\fnArial\fs30}We substantiate our accusations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.97,0:14:15.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,必须要有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}We provide evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.19,0:14:19.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,你虽然很聪明 但在关键问题上非常蠢\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, for a smart guy, you really are a dumbass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.03,0:14:27.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fired, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.64,0:14:29.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我无法再信任你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't trust you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.44,0:14:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生活愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.76,0:14:33.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 一会就好 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Will just take a second. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.20,0:14:36.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.35,0:14:39.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你这个脑子有坑的自恋狂 - 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You are pathologically self-absorbed. - Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.15,0:14:41.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安妮 能先跟我谈谈吗 - 你就只想着刷存在感\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Annie, can you talk to me first? - Your ego requires constant attention, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.20,0:14:42.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且固执得像头犟驴\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're stubborn as hell.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.71,0:14:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我愿意忍气吞声 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I was willing to roll with it, Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.36,0:14:45.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我爱过你\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I loved you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.71,0:14:48.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,「爱过我」 这话是什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}You "loved" me? What is that supposed to mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.08,0:14:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的所作所为害我丢了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}What you did got me fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.99,0:14:54.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你利用了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You used me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.02,0:15:03.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.02,0:15:05.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.52,0:15:39.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.03,0:15:44.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真美\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beautiful.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.56,0:17:43.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三十六次实验\N{\fnArial\fs30}Test 36.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.33,0:17:44.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,两种不同有机体之间\N{\fnArial\fs30}Biological interactions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.90,0:17:46.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,发生的生物交互作用\N{\fnArial\fs30}between two different organisms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.05,0:17:49.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,这些生物需要和能呼吸的宿主彼此结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}These creatures need to bond with a respiratory host{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.92,0:17:51.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,以便能在富氧环境中\N{\fnArial\fs30}in order to survive for any amount of time{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.85,0:17:53.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,存活一段时间\N{\fnArial\fs30}in an oxygen-rich environment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.82,0:17:56.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,为什么这些宿主都会有这么剧烈的排斥反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why are all these hosts showing this hyper-acute rejection?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.81,0:17:58.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,这正是我们想要知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what we're trying to find out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.08,0:18:03.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,结合过程开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The bonding process is starting.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.18,0:18:09.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在稳定\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's equalizing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.41,0:18:18.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但为什么 为什么这只兔子管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}But why? Why this rabbit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.33,0:18:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这有点类似于器官移植\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's similar to an organ transplant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.13,0:18:24.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,捐献者和受赠者必须完全匹配 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the donor and recipient must be an exact match?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.15,0:18:24.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's correct.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.03,0:18:26.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 那仔细想想\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. So wait, think about it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.58,0:18:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们真的实现了共生\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do achieve symbiosis, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.59,0:18:30.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就能在这里生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}they should be able to survive here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.33,0:18:33.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,同样的 我们也能在他们那里存活\N{\fnArial\fs30}but also we would be able to survive there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.60,0:18:36.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"We"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.37,0:18:37.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始人体试验吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Begin human trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.67,0:18:39.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太操之过急 怎么想都为时过早…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's way too soon to even begin to think about something like…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.50,0:18:41.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克斯博士 你已经站在科技突破的边缘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Skirth, you're at the forefront of a scientific breakthrough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.76,0:18:44.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,我希望你能勇敢点 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to hold your nerve. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.39,0:18:45.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I understand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.15,0:18:46.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但这是个伦理问题 - 想想我们的后代\N{\fnArial\fs30}- but it's an ethical question. - Think of future generations.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.50,0:18:47.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想你的孩子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of your kids.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.30,0:18:50.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你的孩子还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, how are your kids?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.77,0:18:53.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始人体试验吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's begin human trials.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.40,0:18:54.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你做得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.72,0:19:18.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 杰克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Jack.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.46,0:19:21.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有没有过这种感觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you ever feel like your life{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.74,0:19:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,觉得自己的人生就是一团糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}is like one monumental screwup?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.12,0:19:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 这里是生命基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nope. - Here at the Life Foundation, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.10,0:19:28.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们一直坚信…\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've always believed…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.44,0:19:29.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是你兄弟吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isn't that your buddy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.57,0:19:30.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,要吃一堑长一智\N{\fnArial\fs30}…in finding the lessons in our disappointments.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.67,0:19:32.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,火箭坠毁之后的几个月里\N{\fnArial\fs30}In the months since our rocket failed, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.90,0:19:34.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们学到了很多东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}we've learned so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.24,0:19:36.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,能不能把电视关了 哥们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you think we could, like, switch him off?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.15,0:19:38.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人还想看呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people are trying to watch that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.66,0:19:40.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就这么喜欢看他吗 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you are, are you? Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.36,0:19:43.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是埃迪·布洛克吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aren't you Eddie Brock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.74,0:19:45.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我曾经是\N{\fnArial\fs30}I used to be.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.86,0:19:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们对项目进程持相同看法\N{\fnArial\fs30}We take the same view of progress.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.82,0:19:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,很激动地向大家宣布 生命基金会\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thrilled to announce that the Life Foundation{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.53,0:19:53.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,已经开始下一轮火箭发射的准备工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}has now begun preparations on its next launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.45,0:19:54.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 杰克 给你小费\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, Jack, this is for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.87,0:19:56.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,别一下子全花光了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do not want you to spend it all at once.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.84,0:19:58.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,那我要回家自娱自乐了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm going to go home and chase myself around the room, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.03,0:20:00.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,假装自己是高冷单身汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}playing hard to get.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.38,0:20:05.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 玛莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Maria.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.48,0:20:06.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.46,0:20:07.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's it going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.70,0:20:09.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,还不错 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Righteous, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.83,0:20:11.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,真好 报箱居然空了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Yeah, we're empty.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.76,0:20:15.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,五美元一份\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cost you $5.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.39,0:20:17.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,五美元买一份原本免费的报纸吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}$5 for a paper that's free?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.51,0:20:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一路走到报箱那里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I walked all the way over to the vending machine, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.63,0:20:22.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,把报纸拿出来 再辛辛苦苦的搬到这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}got the papers out and brought 'em back over here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.25,0:20:24.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了等你来拿的时候能方便一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}so you can have 'em personally delivered to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.84,0:20:26.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是为了我才这么做的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did that for me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.05,0:20:27.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, I did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.04,0:20:29.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,五美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five bucks.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.99,0:20:31.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,这可一点都不便宜\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's pretty steep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.52,0:20:34.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那这样吧 你给我一美元 我给你唱首歌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tell you what, you give me a dollar for a song, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.07,0:20:35.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,报纸就送你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll throw in the paper.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.41,0:20:37.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,要不这样吧 我给你二十美元\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll tell you what, I will give you 20 bucks, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.59,0:20:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,但别唱歌 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but not to sing, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.72,0:20:41.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,成交\N{\fnArial\fs30}Deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.60,0:20:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.65,0:20:43.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.59,0:20:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你才客气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. You're welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.12,0:20:49.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mrs. Chen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.60,0:20:50.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好吗 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.79,0:20:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活总免不了磕磕绊绊 凑合过呗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ah, aches and pains, you know, aches and pains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.91,0:20:55.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.92,0:20:57.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.36,0:20:58.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的脸色太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look like shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.26,0:21:03.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来还是一如既往的漂亮\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you look as beautiful as ever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.38,0:21:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.46,0:21:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,精神反映肉体 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mind is body, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.15,0:21:07.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你最近有按我说的冥想了吗 - 没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Have you been meditating like I showed you? - No, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.81,0:21:09.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没做 那不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have not. And it does not work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.21,0:21:10.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不试试怎么就知道它没用\N{\fnArial\fs30}It doesn't work, because you don't give it a chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.96,0:21:11.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 就是不管用\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, it doesn't work, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.95,0:21:15.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你表弟卖给我的那张DVD是中文的\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I bought a DVD off your cousin, and it was in Mandarin.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.10,0:21:15.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你真是笨啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are so stupid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.37,0:21:17.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要先听啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to listen first.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.33,0:21:22.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,不跟你讲了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't tell you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.96,0:21:19.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看 你刚才说的我完全听不懂\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, that right there, I don't understand what you just said.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.90,0:21:21.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就是问题所在\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.63,0:21:28.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,一瓶威士忌 别忘找我零钱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bottle of whiskey, and don't forget my change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.76,0:21:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.03,0:21:31.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.08,0:21:34.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然保护费就要涨价了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Before the price goes up for my protection.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.74,0:21:39.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,一次性付清 快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}The full payment is due. Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.08,0:21:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,把现金乖乖准备好 陈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make sure you have my money ready, Chen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.28,0:21:44.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可不喜欢等\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't like to wait.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.98,0:22:03.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,生活不易啊 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Life hurts, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.84,0:22:05.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}It just does.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.30,0:22:23.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我得走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I gotta go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.86,0:22:27.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 爱你 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay. Love you, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.76,0:22:29.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,回见 宝贝儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}See you, babe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.59,0:22:34.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是个混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}What a dick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.40,0:23:05.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都没说要去那儿工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not even asking to staff there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.49,0:23:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要这么做 我都没法用自己的名字\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that? I can't use my name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.21,0:23:08.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以用假名\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can use a pseudonym.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.50,0:23:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么名字都行 你选个吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any name. Think… You pick a name.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.95,0:23:12.24,Title,0,0,0,0,,我可以用女名 你看过《窈窕淑男》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could be a woman. Have you seen Tootsie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:19.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再打给你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:19.15,0:23:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 我不会 谢谢 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, I won't. Thank you. Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.68,0:23:31.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,要深刻认识到你所拥有的只有当下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Realize deeply that the present moment is all you ever have.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.32,0:23:35.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,让此时此刻成为你生活的重心\N{\fnArial\fs30}Make the now the primary focus of your life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.07,0:23:38.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,任何行动都比无所作为强\N{\fnArial\fs30}Any action is often better than no action, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.90,0:23:43.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,尤其是当你长时间处于低落时\N{\fnArial\fs30}especially if you have been stuck in an unhappy situation for a long time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.81,0:23:46.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,即使犯了错 至少你也收获了教训\N{\fnArial\fs30}If it is a mistake, at least you learned something, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.07,0:23:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会再重蹈覆辙…\N{\fnArial\fs30}in which case it's no longer…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:07.96,0:24:10.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,感谢各位的付出 使我们得以走到今天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you all for bringing us to this moment.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.64,0:24:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,即便我们化为尘土 我们的名字依然会被铭记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Our names will be spoken long after we are dust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.28,0:24:17.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,历史始于今日\N{\fnArial\fs30}History starts now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.74,0:24:19.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是第一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is day one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.60,0:24:21.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,第一次结合即将开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is first contact.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.78,0:24:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们开工吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's get to work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.21,0:24:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,正在建立实验体监测基线\N{\fnArial\fs30}Establishing subject baseline.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.43,0:24:44.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有生命体征显示正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}All vital signs are normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.10,0:24:52.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,给我接通一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put me through.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.26,0:24:55.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用害怕 以撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need to be frightened, Isaac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:57.42,0:24:58.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,没必要\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:24:58.89,0:25:00.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,以撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:00.32,0:25:02.21,Title,0,0,0,0,,你知道这个名字来源于《圣经》吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that's a biblical name?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:02.34,0:25:03.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, sir.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:03.98,0:25:06.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝曾对亚伯拉罕说“把你的儿子献给我\N{\fnArial\fs30}God said to Abraham, "Give me your son, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.04,0:25:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,“向我证明 你愿意牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}"show me you are willing to sacrifice the one thing{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.91,0:25:11.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,“对你来说最宝贵的东西” 他做到了\N{\fnArial\fs30}"most precious to you, " and Abraham was willing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.00,0:25:14.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这个故事最打动我的是什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know what's always impressed me about that story?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.56,0:25:17.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是亚伯拉罕的牺牲 而是以撒的牺牲\N{\fnArial\fs30}It isn't Abraham's sacrifice. It's Isaac's.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:21.90,0:25:24.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不懂上帝为何会提出这种残酷的要求\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, I don't know what kind of God would ask that of someone, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.36,0:25:26.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我的想法始终没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it doesn't change anything for me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.24,0:25:30.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,以撒一直是这个故事里的英雄\N{\fnArial\fs30}Isaac is still the hero of this story.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:30.72,0:25:33.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看你周围 看看这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look around you. Look at the world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:33.61,0:25:35.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看到了什么 战争 贫穷\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you see? War, poverty, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:35.28,0:25:37.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,这颗星球已经到了崩溃的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}a planet on the brink of collapse.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:37.40,0:25:40.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 上帝已经抛弃了我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would argue that God has abandoned us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.53,0:25:42.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,他没有信守承诺 以撒\N{\fnArial\fs30}He didn't keep his end of the bargain, Isaac, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.13,0:25:44.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以现在轮到你我来做点什么让一切回归正轨\N{\fnArial\fs30}so now it's down to you and me to put this right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.36,0:25:47.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,而这一次 以撒 我们能行\N{\fnArial\fs30}And this time, Isaac, we can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:52.17,0:25:53.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会成功的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.87,0:25:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一次 我不会抛弃大家\N{\fnArial\fs30}This time, I will not abandon us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.20,0:26:00.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.78,0:26:04.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.05,0:26:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西 什么 不…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that? What? No, what…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:19.53,0:26:21.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,求求你让我… 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please let me… No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.14,0:26:23.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, please, please, please!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:40.62,0:26:42.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的生命体征很平稳\N{\fnArial\fs30}His vitals are holding steady.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:43.35,0:26:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它去哪儿了 - 不可思议\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where the hell did it go? - Incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:46.04,0:26:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did it go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:26:52.34,0:26:53.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,它在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.76,0:27:33.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,带下个志愿者过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bring in the next volunteer.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.22,0:28:04.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前是做记者的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I used to be a reporter.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.80,0:28:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:06.33,0:28:08.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且还是一个挺成功的记者 你知道吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pretty successful, as well, you know?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.97,0:28:11.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个工作经常需要我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}My job, it required you to…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.74,0:28:13.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你懂的 去跟踪别人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, to follow people{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.41,0:28:15.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是那些不想被跟踪的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that did not want to be followed{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:15.30,0:28:18.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有就是隐藏自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}and hide in plain sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.66,0:28:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.37,0:28:22.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,这种跟踪最讲究不露痕迹\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to know how to disappear.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.73,0:28:26.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,当年我最在行了 但是你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was pretty good, but, you know, you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:27.15,0:28:29.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是谁 你的跟踪技术都很烂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoever you are, you suck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.14,0:28:31.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.01,0:28:34.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫朵拉·斯克斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, my name is Dora Skirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.22,0:28:35.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你的帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need your help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.23,0:28:37.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我在生命基金会工作 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I work at the Life Foundation. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:37.28,0:28:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是的 - 好工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Wow. Good for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.86,0:28:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.01,0:28:42.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,别…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.50,0:28:45.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,布洛克先生 拜托了 请听我说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Brock, please… Please listen to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.78,0:28:47.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对他的所有控诉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything that you accused him of, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.82,0:28:49.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,都是对的 一切都是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}you were right. It's all true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.33,0:28:50.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我已经不在乎了 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I don't care anymore. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.53,0:28:52.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但德雷克的实验室里招募了很多流浪汉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because he's got a lab filled with poor people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.84,0:28:55.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且他们都签署了自己根本看不懂的弃权声明\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they're all signing waivers that they don't understand, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:55.48,0:28:57.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他把他们当成实验用的小白鼠一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}and he's using them like guinea pigs, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:57.04,0:28:58.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们就快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they are dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.05,0:29:01.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们都快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}They are all dying.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.20,0:29:02.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你亲眼看到了吗 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You've seen that? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.68,0:29:04.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:06.96,0:29:08.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我凭什么相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I believe you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.13,0:29:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这是真的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because it's true.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.44,0:29:10.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以前相信他 而且我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I believed in him, and I…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.05,0:29:12.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我告诉自己这一切都是值得的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I told myself that it was worth it{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.98,0:29:15.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我们是在治愈癌症 但这次的实验不一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}because we were curing cancer, but now this is different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.26,0:29:16.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 有些事情变了 - 去报警吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Something else. - Go to the cops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.81,0:29:18.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.07,0:29:19.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我担心他会伤害我的家人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm afraid of what will happen to my family.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.71,0:29:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是个非常危险的人 而且权力很大 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a very dangerous man, and he's a very powerful man… - I know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.74,0:29:23.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道他有多危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know how dangerous he is, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.07,0:29:24.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我第一次采访他之后\N{\fnArial\fs30}because the very first time I interviewed him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:24.68,0:29:26.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就那一次 第二天我就丢了工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}just once, I lose my job the very next day.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.96,0:29:29.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,事业没了 女朋友没了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my career, I lost my relationship, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:29.48,0:29:32.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,房子也没了 我失去了我所在乎的一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}I lost my apartment, I lost everything I ever cared about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.24,0:29:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道为什么吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.96,0:29:35.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔顿·德雷克毁了我 一切都完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlton Drake ruined me. Finished.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.92,0:29:37.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在 如果真如你所说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, if you are who you say you are, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.02,0:29:40.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,千真万确的话 而且你有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}genuinely, and you have proof, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.33,0:29:43.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你应该非常 非常 非常害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}then you should be very, very, very afraid.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.51,0:29:44.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是很害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.38,0:29:47.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得另请高明了 斯克斯小姐\N{\fnArial\fs30}You need to find yourself another white knight, Ms. Skirth, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.66,0:29:48.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我受够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}because I am done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.80,0:29:50.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我受够了这些鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am done with all of this shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.20,0:29:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}What shit?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.24,0:29:55.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有这些「拯救你的同胞」这种鬼话\N{\fnArial\fs30}All of this "saving my fellow man" shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.55,0:29:57.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗 晚安\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right? Good night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.31,0:30:17.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.40,0:30:19.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:19.73,0:30:22.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮 我只是刚好路过 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anne, I was just walking by, and, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:22.61,0:30:24.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看到了贝尔韦德尔先生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw Mr. Belvedere.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.23,0:30:25.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,我挂念他过的怎么样 所以…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I felt concerned for his welfare, so…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.91,0:30:27.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.68,0:30:29.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位是丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.45,0:30:31.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 丹 这是埃迪 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Dan, this is Eddie. - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.60,0:30:33.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嗨 - 嗨 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey. - Hey, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.28,0:30:34.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮经常提起你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie's told me a lot about you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.85,0:30:35.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.96,0:30:37.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很钦佩你的工作\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a big fan of your work.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.16,0:30:39.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢 - 真的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - Really?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:40.36,0:30:42.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,很酷的工作 他扳倒了很多人\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's pretty cool, all the people that he took down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:43.37,0:30:45.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我就是其中之一\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I was one of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.04,0:30:48.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样吧 你们先聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, look, I'll let you guys catch up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:48.60,0:30:50.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我进屋等你 - 你最好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- So I'll see you inside? - You're the best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.01,0:30:54.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 很高兴见到你 哥们 - 我也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Really nice meeting you, man. - Uh, you, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.92,0:31:03.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有你家的钥匙 你知道这事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has a key. You know he has a key?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.28,0:31:06.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道 不然他怎么进屋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. How else would he get in?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:08.38,0:31:10.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,也是 好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Well, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:11.92,0:31:14.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你最近怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, uh, what you up to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.40,0:31:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道这跟你完全没关系 对吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You realize that's light-years away from being any of your business, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:17.84,0:31:20.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 我只是随便问问\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, well, just asking, you know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:20.64,0:31:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,这位 丹 他是个律师吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, is Dan, uh, a lawyer?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:23.29,0:31:24.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 他是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:25.05,0:31:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,准确来说是外科医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Surgeon, actually.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:28.60,0:31:30.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,贝尔韦德尔先生怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}How's Mr. Belvedere, anyway?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.24,0:31:31.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很想说它很想你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I would say that he misses you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:31.92,0:31:33.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,但那也太假了 因为…\N{\fnArial\fs30}but that would be bullshit, because…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:33.45,0:31:35.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它只是只猫 - 不 因为它从来都不喜欢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's a cat. - No, because he never liked you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:35.25,0:31:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 它是猫 猫谁都不喜欢\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he's a cat, and cats don't like anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:36.61,0:31:38.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你看起来挺好的 你最近好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You look good, by the way. You doing good?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.85,0:31:40.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你来这儿干什么 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here, Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:40.07,0:31:41.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来这里是因为我想你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here because I miss you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:42.21,0:31:43.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常想\N{\fnArial\fs30}A lot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.00,0:31:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们本来都要结婚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, we were gonna get married.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:45.58,0:31:47.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,就在不久之前 但现在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't so long ago, and now, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:48.16,0:31:50.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都不敢相信我们分开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't really believe that we're not…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.71,0:31:54.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还能重新开始吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are we gonna try and find our way back?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.35,0:31:56.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不可能了\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, we can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.49,0:32:01.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你自作自受 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did this, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.90,0:32:05.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,不怪卡尔顿·德雷克 也不怪电视台\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not Carlton Drake, not the network.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:32:05.73,0:32:06.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怪你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:14.41,0:33:16.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 这里是斯克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, hello. This is Dr. Skirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.08,0:33:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是埃迪·布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Eddie Brock here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.05,0:33:20.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们得谈谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}Talk to me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.21,0:33:26.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,你确定这样能行吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you sure this is gonna work?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.39,0:33:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴下 别说话就行了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just stay down and shut up, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:29.83,0:33:32.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,53.5 上方909RPM\N{\fnArial\fs30}53.5, win-909 RPM.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:39.48,0:33:42.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,地球的人口过剩和气候变化\N{\fnArial\fs30}Overpopulation and climate change.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.22,0:33:44.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,这两件事德雷克也没法控制\N{\fnArial\fs30}These are two things that Drake cannot control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:44.51,0:33:45.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, got it, right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.44,0:33:49.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,再过一代 地球就不再适合我们人类居住了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are literally a generation away from an uninhabitable Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:49.41,0:33:52.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 对 - 德雷克想用他的私人火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Uh, yeah. - Drake is using his personal rockets{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.37,0:33:54.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,来搜寻宜居之所\N{\fnArial\fs30}to scout real estate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:54.35,0:33:55.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,这故事挺有意思的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it's a really interesting story, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.93,0:33:58.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们还是直接跳到他杀人的那部分吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}but we need to just get to the part where he's killing people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:33:58.65,0:34:01.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克派了一艘飞船去执行搜寻任务\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake sent a ship on a recon mission.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.35,0:34:04.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,返程的时候 他们发现了一颗彗星\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the way back, they found a comet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.39,0:34:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,一颗彗星\N{\fnArial\fs30}A comet?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:05.67,0:34:09.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,船载计算机显示那里有生命迹象 有成千上万个生物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Onboard computers indicated the presence of life, of millions of organisms.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.56,0:34:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 等等 你说有成千上万个生物体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, wait, wait, when you say "millions of organisms, "{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:11.53,0:34:13.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么意思 - 我们带回来了一些样本\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what do you mean? - We brought back some specimens.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:13.20,0:34:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是说外星人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're talking about aliens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.88,0:34:17.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,那种…外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, aliens?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:18.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,E.T。要给家里打电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}E.T. phone home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:18.81,0:34:20.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,外星人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aliens, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.51,0:34:21.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.96,0:34:24.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我们不这么叫它\N{\fnArial\fs30}But we don't call them that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.99,0:34:28.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们称它为共生体 - 共生体\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We call them Symbiotes. - Symbiotes?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.07,0:34:30.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们无法在我们的环境中独立生存\N{\fnArial\fs30}And they cannot survive in our environment without help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.00,0:34:35.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克认为 人类与共生体的结合\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake believes that the union between human and Symbiote{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.22,0:34:38.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们存活的关键 但不是在地球上\N{\fnArial\fs30}is the key to our survival, but not here on Earth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.08,0:34:42.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克想把人类和外星人结合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake is trying to put human beings and aliens together?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:42.60,0:34:44.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是为了能在太空生活\N{\fnArial\fs30}So they can live in space?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.21,0:34:45.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们称这种人类为宿主\N{\fnArial\fs30}We call them hosts.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.55,0:34:48.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太疯狂了 对吧 他简直就是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's nuts, isn't it? That's completely insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.34,0:34:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 这事根本没有试验方案\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. There's no protocol for this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.48,0:34:51.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他就是强行匹配\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's just feeding them in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:51.91,0:34:53.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果匹配失败…\N{\fnArial\fs30}If the match isn't exact…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:53.63,0:34:55.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,电梯巡逻检查\N{\fnArial\fs30}Elevators patrol check.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:34:58.49,0:35:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,快进去 别碰任何东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, just go in. Don't touch anything.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.54,0:35:02.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我不会的 - 快走 我来应付他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I won't. I won't. - Go, go, go. I'll take care of him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.06,0:35:06.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Skirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.49,0:35:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我以为你们都回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you'd all gone home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.77,0:35:10.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 不过 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yes. Well, you know what they say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.57,0:35:12.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,科学不知疲倦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Science never sleeps.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.71,0:36:23.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 是我 放我出去 - 玛莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie! It's me. Let me out! - Maria? Maria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:23.74,0:36:25.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 拜托了 快让我出去 - 我不知道怎么让你出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please! Let me out! - I don't know how to get you…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.39,0:36:28.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快让我出去 快 - 我不知道怎么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Let me out. Out. - I don't know how.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:28.35,0:36:29.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.80,0:36:45.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 玛莉亚 住手 玛莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Maria, no! Maria!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:45.94,0:36:48.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉亚 别 玛莉亚 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria! No, Maria, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.90,0:37:01.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,第三区实验室出现安全漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}There has been a security breach in Lab Sector 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:01.87,0:37:03.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 玛莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no. Maria?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.09,0:37:04.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,玛莉亚\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maria!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.28,0:37:05.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:05.56,0:37:08.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,重复 这是银色级别安全漏洞\N{\fnArial\fs30}Repeat, this is a Code Silver security breach.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.26,0:37:10.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所有安保人员 请迅速前往第三区实验室\N{\fnArial\fs30}All security personnel, please respond to Lab Sector 3.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:14.15,0:37:15.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Freeze!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:37:47.35,0:37:48.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,发现目标\N{\fnArial\fs30}Got eyes on!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:03.75,0:38:04.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.82,0:38:06.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,追 快追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go! Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.12,0:38:18.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,他跑哪儿去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where the hell'd he go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.31,0:38:19.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我没看到他 - 分头找\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm not seeing him. - Fan out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:19.92,0:38:21.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 找到他 - 没有 还没找到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Find him. - Nothing. Nothing yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.04,0:38:24.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,第四搜索队 第四搜索队\N{\fnArial\fs30}Search Team 4, Search Team 4.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.08,0:38:36.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,往东二百英尺去追\N{\fnArial\fs30}Backtrack 200 feet east.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:40.31,0:38:42.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是朵拉 请留言\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dora. Leave a message.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:42.13,0:38:44.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,斯克斯 是我 我刚到家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Skirth, yeah, it's me. I just got back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:44.96,0:38:46.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗 你没联系我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right? I haven't heard from you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:46.97,0:38:48.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想知道你现在情况如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}so I want to know if you're all right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.49,0:38:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过没错 实验室里的事真是个猛料\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, yeah, that was a great call on the lab.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:50.28,0:38:51.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是对的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're absolutely right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:52.25,0:38:53.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 听着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Listen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.86,0:38:56.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有个线人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got a… I got a guy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.22,0:38:58.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在准备打电话给他 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna call him and, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:01.24,0:39:03.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拍了好多的照片\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I got a bunch of photographs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.17,0:39:05.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,他说会刊登这些照片 但是我需要你跟我一起过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}He will publish those photographs, but I need you to come with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:05.79,0:39:07.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,回个电话给我 别忘了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, could you just call me back? Call me back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.70,0:39:33.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,太棒了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:39:52.34,0:39:54.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,我这是怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is wrong with me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.88,0:40:02.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:11.83,0:40:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有多严重\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.88,0:40:14.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常糟\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:15.10,0:40:16.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,说具体点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}How bad?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:16.50,0:40:19.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,入侵者把共生体带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, we assume the intruder took it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:21.07,0:40:23.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,带走了 带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Took it? Took it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.54,0:40:26.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都不知道发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}We don't know what happened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:26.93,0:40:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要和昨晚值班的每一个人谈话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to speak to every man who was on duty last night.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.69,0:40:29.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 已经谈过了 先生 - 但是我还没谈\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Already did, sir. - But I didn't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.91,0:40:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,赶紧把尸体给我移走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get it out of my sight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.19,0:40:33.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 卡尔顿 你得看看这个 - 又怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Carlton, you need to see this. - What now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:33.99,0:40:35.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的血压恢复到正常值了\N{\fnArial\fs30}His blood pressure's back to normal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:35.95,0:40:37.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,肝功能也正常了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liver functions, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:40.05,0:40:41.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:41.85,0:40:44.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体只是需要时间来适应\N{\fnArial\fs30}See, his body just needed time to adjust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.89,0:40:48.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,没时间可浪费了 马上扩大试验规模\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to waste any more time. I want to up the tests.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:49.03,0:40:50.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好吗 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:52.39,0:40:53.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,走吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:54.64,0:40:55.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你被解雇了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're fired.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:56.34,0:40:58.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,把我的共生体找回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Find my Symbiote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:40:58.40,0:40:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,马上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:20.16,0:41:21.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jesus.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:42.78,0:41:45.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,请注意 乘坐2517次航班\N{\fnArial\fs30}Attention, passengers for Flight 2517{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:45.90,0:41:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,经香港飞往旧金山的乘客\N{\fnArial\fs30}to San Francisco via Hong Kong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:48.60,0:41:52.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,十五分钟后在九号登机口登机\N{\fnArial\fs30}We will be boarding at gate 9 in 15 minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:52.64,0:41:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,请出示登机牌\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please have your boarding passes…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:41:54.58,0:41:56.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,苏茜 过来 在这边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Suzy. Come on, over here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:05.72,0:42:07.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,麻烦找一下安妮·韦英\N{\fnArial\fs30}May I speak to Annie Weying, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:08.05,0:42:10.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉她有急事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you tell her that it's an emergency?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:10.30,0:42:11.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Food.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:12.32,0:42:13.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁在说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who said that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:14.30,0:42:16.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不是跟你说的\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I'm not talking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:16.54,0:42:18.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能告诉我她在哪吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you please tell me where she is?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:19.61,0:42:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,太好了 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Great. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:26.71,0:42:27.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:32.43,0:42:34.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 拉娜 两人用餐吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, Lana for two?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:34.48,0:42:35.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不好意思 先生 - 行了 知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry, sir? - Yeah. Yeah. Yeah, yeah, yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:35.78,0:42:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 太好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - Oh, yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:36.97,0:42:39.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 埃迪 你怎么在这 - 安妮…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, my God, Eddie. What are you doing here? - Annie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:39.48,0:42:41.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不… - 不是 我有些事得告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no… - No, I have to tell you something.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:41.31,0:42:42.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不不不 求你了 - 不 我必须现在说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, no, no. Please. - No, now. I have to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:42.67,0:42:44.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,我打听到你在这 你是我唯一信任的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Work told me you were here. You're the only person that I trust.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:44.86,0:42:45.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你喝醉了吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you drunk? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:45.72,0:42:47.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 我闯进了生命基金会 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I broke into the Life Foundation. - Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:47.60,0:42:49.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你干了什么 - 是啊 但我可能…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- you did what? - Yeah, but I may…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:49.13,0:42:50.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我觉得我可能被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think I may have been infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:50.62,0:42:52.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在发烧 你体温很高 - 埃迪 你看起来不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's burning up. You're really hot. - Eddie, you look like you're in a bad way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:52.58,0:42:54.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 我确实不太好\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am. I am in a bad way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:57.70,0:42:59.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, Jesus!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:42:59.91,0:43:01.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,这个不新鲜\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:01.73,0:43:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:03.02,0:43:04.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 快坐下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, sit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:04.50,0:43:06.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题 好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, all right. Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:06.10,0:43:08.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 埃迪 - 够了 别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, hey, Eddie, Eddie, Eddie. - Stop that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:08.07,0:43:09.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 对不起 - 埃迪 快停下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, sir, sir, I'm so sorry. - Eddie, quit it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:09.31,0:43:10.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,快放下 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Put it down. Eddie!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:10.86,0:43:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,清醒点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Snap out of it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:15.06,0:43:16.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:16.09,0:43:17.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 这个不好吃\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right. It's no good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:17.83,0:43:19.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,鲍比 你没事吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bobby, are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:20.65,0:43:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 等下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey, hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:22.00,0:43:23.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是医生 我是医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm a doctor. I'm a doctor.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:24.92,0:43:26.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我好热啊 大家都不热吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hot. Is anyone else hot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:26.79,0:43:27.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,你受伤了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you hurt?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:28.01,0:43:29.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 对不起 - 不 闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir, excuse me. - No! Shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:29.24,0:43:30.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 你要去哪儿 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, where are you going? Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:30.65,0:43:32.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,太过分了 我要报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is unacceptable. I'm gonna call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:32.58,0:43:33.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 不 求你别这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing? No, please don't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:34.01,0:43:35.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 埃迪 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No. - Eddie, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:35.36,0:43:36.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:42.48,0:43:44.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我现在必须报警了 - 不 请别报警\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Now I'm gonna call the police. - No, no. Please don't call the police.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:44.55,0:43:46.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,快叫救护车 我是医生 他是我的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here, call an ambulance. I'm a doctor. This man is my, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:47.52,0:43:48.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Patient.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:49.03,0:43:50.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,感觉好多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, it's much better.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:50.48,0:43:51.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你疯了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:51.85,0:43:53.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在杀人 - 谁在杀人\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's killing people. - Who's killing people?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:53.68,0:43:54.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,卡尔顿·德雷克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carlton Drake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:54.54,0:43:56.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 埃迪 别来这套 - 是的 就是他\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God, Eddie not this again. - Yes, he is. He is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:43:56.12,0:43:57.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我有证据\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I have proof!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:06.37,0:44:08.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eddie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.12,0:44:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:16.56,0:44:17.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:18.88,0:44:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 能听到吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, can you hear me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:21.69,0:44:23.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Dan speaking to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:24.25,0:44:26.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:26.68,0:44:28.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你终于醒了 - 我这是在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Welcome back. - Where am I?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:28.19,0:44:29.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在核磁共振室\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, you're in the MRI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:29.49,0:44:31.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们给你注射了点的镇静剂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, we've given you a little sedative.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:31.42,0:44:34.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 安妮在哪儿 - 她现在不在这\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is Anne? - Anne is not here right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:34.13,0:44:35.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要给你做些检查 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna run some tests, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:35.73,0:44:36.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不会有任何痛苦\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's gonna be completely painless.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.88,0:44:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 你只要安静的躺着就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you know, just try to stay still.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:38.95,0:44:40.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,放松 然后…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, relax, and, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:41.87,0:44:42.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 开始了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, here we go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:48.93,0:44:50.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, what's happening in there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:50.75,0:44:52.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, you okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:44:56.16,0:44:57.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,快关掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut it down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:00.94,0:45:02.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没事了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're okay. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:02.13,0:45:04.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,出来 你还好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Coming out. You all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:04.44,0:45:05.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还好 - 看着我 看着我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - Here, look at me, look at me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:05.93,0:45:07.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:07.45,0:45:09.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 深呼吸 好吗 你没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right. - Just take a deep breath. Okay? You're okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:10.64,0:45:11.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:11.34,0:45:13.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 害怕检查的人不止你一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now, listen, you're not the first person to freak out in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:13.55,0:45:14.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也有幽闭恐怖症\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get claustrophobic, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:15.02,0:45:16.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,路易斯医生\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dr. Lewis?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:16.99,0:45:18.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 嘿 曼弗雷迪女士 你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, boy. - Hey, Mrs. Manfredi. How are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:18.92,0:45:20.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚看见莫里斯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I just saw Morris.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:20.50,0:45:23.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,他又在那里不停地发牢骚 像个老小孩似的\N{\fnArial\fs30}And he's whining and complaining like an old baby again.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:23.77,0:45:25.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 真想不到 - 非常感谢你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, good. - Oh, thank you so much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:25.52,0:45:27.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,没事 我的荣幸\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, my pleasure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:27.54,0:45:29.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 曼弗雷迪女士 我们已经说过狗的问题了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, Mrs. Manfredi, we talked about the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.44,0:45:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,我喜欢狗 但是你不能在医院养它\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, love the dog. You can't have the dog.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:31.08,0:45:32.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 杰米尼 别叫了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry. Gemini.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:32.74,0:45:34.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会把你的病情彻底查清 好吗 我向你保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna get to the bottom of this. All right? That I can promise you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:34.66,0:45:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在你还是回家休息一下吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}But for now, go home, get some rest.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:36.44,0:45:37.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,检查结果出来我再打给你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll call you when your tests are in. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:37.50,0:45:38.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 谢谢你 - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- All right, thank you. - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:38.82,0:45:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢谢你 丹 谢谢你 - 不用客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you, Dan. Thank you. - You got it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:42.82,0:45:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 博士 - 你好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hello, Doctor. - Hi.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:44.29,0:45:45.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,你那边也是相同的反应吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did you have the same reactions{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:45.62,0:45:47.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,不用考虑温度问题…\N{\fnArial\fs30}regardless of the temperature…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:50.16,0:45:52.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,下午好 斯克斯博士\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good afternoon, Dr. Skirth.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:56.87,0:45:59.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,共生体和宿主已经合为一体\N{\fnArial\fs30}The creature and the host are one.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:45:59.12,0:46:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,一切都很正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything was fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.57,0:46:03.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那为什么宿主的身体还是会越来越衰弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, why does the human continue to waste away?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:03.44,0:46:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道 给他注入的营养液喂大象都够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know. We've given him enough liquid nutrition to feed an elephant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:06.32,0:46:07.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,但共生体完全没影响吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But the organism is unaffected?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:07.84,0:46:09.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 共生体生命力很健壮 - 那就好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The Symbiote is thriving. - Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:09.20,0:46:11.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,但问题还在于 共生体在逐渐蚕食宿主\N{\fnArial\fs30}But once again, it's killing the host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:11.54,0:46:13.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,它让宿主的器官衰竭\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's consuming his organs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:13.95,0:46:15.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, watch this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:19.52,0:46:22.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干什么 他伤到它了 快住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, whoa, what are you doing? You're hurting it. Stop it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:22.87,0:46:26.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,四千至六千赫兹的声音会对它造成很大的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sounds in the 4, 000 to 6, 000 hertz range are very harmful for it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:26.27,0:46:28.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那就别弄出这样的声音 - 好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, then don't make those sounds. - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:29.98,0:46:31.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,他之前一直很稳定 到底发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was stabilizing. What happened?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:31.86,0:46:33.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,他马上就要急性肝衰竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's approaching acute liver failure.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:34.22,0:46:35.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们需要再找一个宿主\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're gonna need another host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:36.02,0:46:37.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,设计得太差了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Such poor design.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:38.11,0:46:39.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:39.36,0:46:40.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说人类\N{\fnArial\fs30}Human beings.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:40.77,0:46:42.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 打断你们一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry to interrupt.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:44.96,0:46:46.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可能需要些好消息\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thought you'd like some good news.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.61,0:46:48.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:46:59.26,0:47:00.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,饿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hungry!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:00.67,0:47:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, goddamn.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:02.98,0:47:04.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没事 不用担心我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm okay. Don't worry about me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:04.98,0:47:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,能借过一下吗 不好意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can I get through, please? Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:07.18,0:47:08.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:08.37,0:47:09.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我就站在这里 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna stay here, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:09.89,0:47:12.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,等这辆电车停下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Until the cable car stops.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.36,0:47:19.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,都没事儿 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're good. All right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:19.06,0:47:20.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:20.38,0:47:21.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,借过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Excuse me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:26.94,0:47:28.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Anne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:28.08,0:47:30.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 嗨 你感觉怎么样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, hi. How you feeling?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.96,0:47:32.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感觉 我是病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, feeling… I'm sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:32.97,0:47:34.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:34.20,0:47:35.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你感染了寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}you have a parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:35.95,0:47:37.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们还不确定它的来源\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're not exactly sure how you got it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:37.76,0:47:39.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,但这可以解释你为什么发烧了\N{\fnArial\fs30}but it would explain the fever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:39.91,0:47:41.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,这就说得通了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That would make sense.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:41.18,0:47:44.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我一直能听到一个声音\N{\fnArial\fs30}Also, I'm hearing, uh, a voice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:44.84,0:47:46.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,幻听实际上十分常见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auditory hallucinations are actually very common.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:46.87,0:47:48.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 丹 你好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, hey, Dan. How you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:48.39,0:47:50.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不知道你也在听电话\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't realize that you were on the call, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:50.24,0:47:51.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我在\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:52.06,0:47:53.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹 这个寄生虫…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Dan, would this parasite…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:53.58,0:47:55.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,它能够让我 我不知道该怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Would it, like, be able to make me, I don't know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:55.89,0:47:59.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,比如 它能够让我爬上一棵很高很高的树\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like, climb a really, really, really tall tree, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:47:59.09,0:48:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且速度非常非常快吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but super, super fast?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:01.16,0:48:02.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,没错 我们刚刚就这么做了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes. We just did.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:02.89,0:48:04.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 这可能是因为\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, well, Eddie, it sounds like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.21,0:48:06.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的新陈代谢不太正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}it might be causing some metabolic abnormalities{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:06.10,0:48:08.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以你的体液环境也不太平衡\N{\fnArial\fs30}that are making it hard for your body to maintain homeostasis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:08.77,0:48:11.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚说什么「代谢」、「体液」 我听不明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said "causing" and "body, " and… I lost you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:11.34,0:48:13.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 埃迪 我们会给你一些药物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, Eddie, um, we are gonna get you on some meds, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:13.40,0:48:14.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,将你体内的寄生虫清理出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we are gonna clear that out.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:14.48,0:48:16.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 - 这是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yes. - Never gonna happen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:16.21,0:48:18.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能不能别这样 现在不是时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you stop doing that now. Not now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:18.88,0:48:20.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 我们只是想帮你 - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie, we're just trying to help you. - I know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.72,0:48:23.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道 我刚刚不是在和你说话 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know. I'm just, I'm not actually talking to you, Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:23.21,0:48:24.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你在跟谁说话\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who are you talking to?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:24.98,0:48:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,我等会儿再打给你 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm just gonna call you back, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:26.50,0:48:29.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢 谢谢 丹 谢谢你们俩\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you. Thank you, Dan. Thank you. Thank you, both.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.05,0:48:45.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:45.94,0:48:47.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 你能把音乐声关小点吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, can you turn your music down, please?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:47.73,0:48:49.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为我现在真的很难受\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause I'm having a really hard time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:49.86,0:48:50.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,管你呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:53.99,0:48:55.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 哥们 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, sure, man. Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:48:55.29,0:48:57.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我马上把声音调小 抱歉 - 谢谢 谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'll just turn it right down. Sorry. - Thank you. Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:00.72,0:49:03.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,对于我们现在所做的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was troubled by{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:03.99,0:49:05.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,我感到很不安\N{\fnArial\fs30}what we've been doing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:05.86,0:49:07.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:07.46,0:49:08.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:10.02,0:49:11.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们都有感到不安的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've all been troubled.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.55,0:49:14.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是人的正常反应\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's the nature of what we do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:15.73,0:49:19.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,但你需要告诉我 昨天谁和你一起来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I need you to tell me who was here with you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:20.49,0:49:22.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你告诉我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need that from you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:24.86,0:49:26.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't do that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.99,0:49:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有找到了你的那位朋友 我们的研究\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can't fix things unless we begin with{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:31.76,0:49:33.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,才能继续\N{\fnArial\fs30}your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.31,0:49:35.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有找到他 才能帮他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The person who was here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.52,0:49:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为他会死的 他现在很危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because they're gonna die. They're in great danger.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:38.37,0:49:39.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know that, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:40.69,0:49:42.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,只有找到他 把他们带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're gonna die unless we bring them back here, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:43.05,0:49:45.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你才能帮助他和共生体活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}where you can help to keep them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:48.50,0:49:50.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 朵拉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Dora.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:51.51,0:49:54.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我保证 从今以后 我们会改变实验方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}I promise, from here on in, we will do things differently.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:49:57.74,0:49:59.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能相信我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Will you trust me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:05.92,0:50:07.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪·布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.54,0:50:08.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪·布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie Brock?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.46,0:50:20.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,你曾是我们最好的研究员\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were our best.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:20.79,0:50:21.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.56,0:50:27.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:28.02,0:50:29.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No! No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:34.68,0:50:36.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not open that door.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:51.71,0:50:52.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,别动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay put.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:53.82,0:50:55.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 嘿 埃迪 - 这家伙是谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hey, Eddie. - Who the hell is this guy?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.84,0:50:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来取回德雷克先生的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna need Mr. Drake's property back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:50:59.84,0:51:01.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在干吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:01.29,0:51:02.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm, uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:02.52,0:51:03.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把手举起来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm putting my hands up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:04.00,0:51:06.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你让我们看起来很怂\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are making us look bad.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:06.40,0:51:09.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我…不 我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I… No, I am not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:09.57,0:51:10.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, you are.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:10.80,0:51:12.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 - 明明有\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not. - Yes, you are!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:12.26,0:51:13.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 我没有 - 你为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I'm not. - Why would you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.94,0:51:15.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这时候就应该举手\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause it is a very sensible thing to do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:16.00,0:51:18.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪… - 那我就自己来处理了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie… - I will take care of this myself.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:18.46,0:51:20.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么 - 埃迪 东西在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What? - Eddie, where's the bug?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:22.23,0:51:23.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,把他拿下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take him down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:34.10,0:51:36.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,很抱歉伤害了你的朋友们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm so sorry about your friends.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.05,0:51:47.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是什么东西 - 应该问「是谁」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What is that? - Not "what." Who.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:51:59.06,0:52:00.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:22.08,0:52:23.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,非常好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Outstanding.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:23.93,0:52:26.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在让我们咬下他们的头 然后把他们堆在角落里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now let's bite all their heads off and pile them up in the corner.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:26.48,0:52:27.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们为什么要这么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would we do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:27.60,0:52:30.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,那边堆身体 这边堆头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pile of bodies, pile of heads.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:37.64,0:52:39.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么鬼东西 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the shit, man{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:45.11,0:52:47.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! No, no, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:53.58,0:52:55.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 什么鬼 - 老兄 你是怎么做到的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What the hell? - Dude! How did you do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:52:55.93,0:52:58.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,很显然 我有寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}Apparently, I have a parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:06.47,0:53:09.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克先生 目标带着共生体跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Mr. Drake, our subject is carrying the Symbiote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:09.11,0:53:10.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在给您传输刚才的画面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Connecting you to the feed now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:15.73,0:53:17.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,他和共生体成功结合了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's achieved symbiosis.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:17.37,0:53:18.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,看到了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:18.49,0:53:21.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们看到了吗 他竟然成功了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you seeing this? He's achieved symbiosis!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:22.57,0:53:23.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里斯…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treece…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:23.84,0:53:26.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里斯 把我的新物种带回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treece, bring me back my creature.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:34.36,0:53:35.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:45.34,0:53:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,你没在里面 对吧 我只是产生了幻觉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not even here, are you? I'm just seeing things.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:47.68,0:53:49.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不是真的 你只是我的幻想\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not real. You're in my head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:49.76,0:53:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你只不过是个寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}'Cause you're just a parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:51.40,0:53:52.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,「寄生虫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Parasite"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:53:59.68,0:54:01.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你这是得脑瘤了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a brain tumor, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:05.42,0:54:07.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了 在舒勒大楼后面的小巷里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him. He's in the alley behind the Schueller Building.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:07.78,0:54:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉把你叫做寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am sorry that I called you a parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:09.42,0:54:11.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,我也愿意和你平等地交流\N{\fnArial\fs30}We can discuss this like two men.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:11.88,0:54:13.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么 是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that? What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:21.70,0:54:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:23.85,0:54:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,别让他跑了 明白我的意思吗 特里斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not let him get away. Do you understand me, Treece?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:26.53,0:54:28.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,收到 武器已经准备好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy. Weapons are armed and ready.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:29.00,0:54:30.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,出动无人机\N{\fnArial\fs30}Launch the drones.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:54:59.37,0:55:00.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,低头\N{\fnArial\fs30}Duck.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:04.30,0:55:06.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 谢了 - 不客气\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Thank you. - You are welcome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:22.67,0:55:25.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,这简直难以置信\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is beyond anything we thought was possible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:31.92,0:55:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:55:56.00,0:55:57.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holy shit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:04.90,0:56:06.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里斯 别让他溜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treece, do not let him get away.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:07.08,0:56:09.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找到他了 所有地面人员 开车追\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've got him. All ground vehicles, move in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:15.43,0:56:17.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,目标正沿着格兰特大街向东行驶\N{\fnArial\fs30}Target is now eastbound on Grant.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:18.94,0:56:20.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 快做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God! Do something!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:28.34,0:56:29.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么…\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:35.65,0:56:38.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒 又来了几个朋友 太爽了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah! We got more friends. Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:42.46,0:56:43.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no! No, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:46.40,0:56:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你疯了吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You're out of your mind!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:56:49.68,0:56:52.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:11.76,0:57:13.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,前面没有路了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is a dead-end!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:13.11,0:57:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还有路\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not for us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:57:23.56,0:57:24.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,真棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:02.74,0:58:04.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am going to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:04.32,0:58:06.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不会死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are not going to die!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:17.91,0:58:20.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,刚才真是太酷了 不骗你…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa! That was pretty cool, actually. I'm not gonna lie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:29.38,0:58:30.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:30.43,0:58:32.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 把他带回来 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bring him home. - Copy that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:32.53,0:58:33.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,真是太不可思议了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is incredible.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:40.10,0:58:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你可真是能给我找事 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have been a serious pain in the ass for me, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:43.07,0:58:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 你知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you know, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:44.65,0:58:46.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,我本来是想讨你欢心的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I aim to please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:58:57.74,0:59:01.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,眼睛 肺 还有胰脏\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eyes, lungs, pancreas.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:01.62,0:59:04.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,都很好吃 可惜时间不多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}So many snacks, so little time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:14.91,0:59:16.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,旧金山警察 不许动\N{\fnArial\fs30}SFPD. Don't move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:16.88,0:59:18.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,从车上下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the car!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:34.72,0:59:35.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My legs.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:37.99,0:59:39.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 我的腿明明断了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God, my legs were broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:39.85,0:59:41.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,可现在却好好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now they're not broken.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:41.76,0:59:43.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:57.39,0:59:59.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你到底是什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,0:59:59.59,1:00:01.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我叫毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am Venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:02.07,1:00:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体属于我\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you are mine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:04.74,1:00:07.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你刚把别人的头给咬下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You bit somebody's head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:07.43,1:00:09.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要补充体力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fuel in the tank.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:09.32,1:00:11.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,听好了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen carefully, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:11.44,1:00:13.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,不是你找到的我们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did not find us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:13.75,1:00:16.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我们找上了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}We found you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:16.41,1:00:18.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在就是我的坐骑\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think of yourself as my ride.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:18.63,1:00:19.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要去哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are you going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:19.91,1:00:22.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们要搭上德雷克的那艘火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}We need Carlton Drake's rocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:23.01,1:00:24.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还记得他吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}You remember him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:25.05,1:00:26.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是怎么知道这事儿的\N{\fnArial\fs30}How do you even know about that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:26.58,1:00:28.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我无所不知 埃迪 - 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I know everything, Eddie. - You do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:28.88,1:00:30.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我知道你的一切 - 怎么知道的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Everything about you. - How?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:30.62,1:00:33.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我在你的脑子里\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am inside your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:33.11,1:00:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,你就是个废物 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are a loser, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:40.28,1:00:43.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还要再去吃其他人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you gonna eat anybody else?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:43.12,1:00:44.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,很有可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}Most likely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:44.64,1:00:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:45.92,1:00:48.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们来地球就是为了食物\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is why we are here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:48.80,1:00:52.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,乖乖合作 你才有可能活下去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Cooperate, and you might just survive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:53.48,1:00:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的条件\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the deal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:00:58.76,1:01:00.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,晚上好 女士们 先生们\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good evening, ladies and gentlemen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:00.48,1:01:01.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,欢迎来到旧金山\N{\fnArial\fs30}Welcome to San Francisco.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:02.00,1:01:04.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,为了您的安全 请不要离开座位…\N{\fnArial\fs30}For your safety and comfort, please remain seated…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:25.08,1:01:26.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,亲爱的 我快到家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, babe. I'm almost home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:26.83,1:01:28.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪在哪里 - 怎么了 发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where's Eddie? - Why? What's happening?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:28.69,1:01:31.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,我拿到了埃迪的检查报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got Eddie's labs back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:32.24,1:01:33.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我想的还糟糕\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it's worse than I thought.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:34.15,1:01:37.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,他的身体 肾脏 内分泌 全都不正常\N{\fnArial\fs30}His systems, renal, endocrine, they're behaving abnormally.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:37.65,1:01:38.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,我从没见过这样的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I've never seen anything like it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:38.55,1:01:40.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是什么意思 丹 你想说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean, Dan? What are you telling me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:40.85,1:01:42.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你得把他带过来 - 天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You need to get him here. - My God.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:46.24,1:01:48.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪·布洛克 请留言 - 该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie Brock here. Leave a message. - Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:54.70,1:01:57.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,共生体离开斯克斯的时候 你在哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where were you when it left Dr. Skirth's body?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:58.25,1:01:59.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他当时在哪儿 - 我在…\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where was he? - I was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:01:59.74,1:02:01.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是一种高等生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the higher life-form.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:02.00,1:02:04.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,而你却看着它死掉\N{\fnArial\fs30}You stood by and watched while it died.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:05.68,1:02:06.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,太自大了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The arrogance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:12.12,1:02:14.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里斯 听着 出了这档事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treece, listen to me. After this, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:14.50,1:02:16.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在不能冒险干掉布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}we can't risk killing Brock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:16.39,1:02:18.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非我们找到下一个合适的宿主\N{\fnArial\fs30}not until we find another suitable host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:18.69,1:02:20.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我再也不想看见你这张脸了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want to see you again{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:20.32,1:02:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,除非你把布洛克抓回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}unless you have Brock!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:27.74,1:02:30.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,警官 发生了什么事 我需要进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer, what's happening? I need to get in there.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:30.12,1:02:32.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这是我朋友的公寓 - 公寓已经被疏散了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's my friend's apartment. - Building's been evacuated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:32.40,1:02:33.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这里不安全 女士\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not safe for you to be here, madam.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:33.46,1:02:34.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,又找到一个 比尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Found another one, Bill.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:35.23,1:02:37.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,别待在外面 回家吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get off the streets. Go home.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:37.18,1:02:38.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,今晚城里到处是尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's bodies all over the city tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:38.72,1:02:40.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Bodies?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:41.25,1:02:43.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,天啊 埃迪 你到底在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}My God, Eddie, where are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:45.93,1:02:48.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮是谁 你的心跳加快了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who is Anne? Your pulse has quickened.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:48.41,1:02:50.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,这不关你的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is none of your goddamn business.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:50.32,1:02:52.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你所有的事都和我有关系 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everything of yours is my business, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:52.80,1:02:54.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我之间没有秘密\N{\fnArial\fs30}We have no secrets.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:54.21,1:02:55.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,是吗 那你一定知道我为什么要来这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah? Well, then you know exactly why I'm going here{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:55.97,1:02:57.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,而不是先跟你去找火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}before we get to your rocket, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:02:57.60,1:03:00.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然 我又不是不讲道理\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure. I'm not unreasonable.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:00.68,1:03:01.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.21,1:03:02.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,喂\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:02.80,1:03:04.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 谢天谢地 你在哪儿 我得见你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie. Thank God. Where are you? I need to see you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:04.86,1:03:06.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不行 你不能见我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, you can't see me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:06.74,1:03:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 我得你告诉我你在哪 我过去接你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I need you to tell me where you are. I'm coming to get you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:08.88,1:03:10.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你绝对不能靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, you cannot come anywhere near me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:10.68,1:03:12.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在不能靠近我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot come near me right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:12.84,1:03:14.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,理查德 嘿 理查德…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Richard. Hey, Richard…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:14.28,1:03:15.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No.- Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:15.19,1:03:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我得上去 - 你知道你不该来这里的 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No, I gotta go up there. - You know you're not supposed to be here, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:16.92,1:03:18.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,我必须得上去 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to get up there, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:18.35,1:03:20.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我挺喜欢你的 兄弟 但你不能上去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look, I got love for you, bro, but no can do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:20.80,1:03:22.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,没什么是不可能的\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no such thing as can't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:22.63,1:03:23.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 老兄\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:24.38,1:03:26.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 好吧…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay, okay… Uh…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:26.72,1:03:29.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能把这个给他吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you, uh, just give him this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:29.27,1:03:31.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他得看看这上面的东西 - 埃迪 拜托\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He needs to see what's on it. - Eddie, please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:31.20,1:03:33.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我需要这份工作 - 把他的脑袋咬下来吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I really need this job. - Let's eat his brains.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:33.33,1:03:34.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 你不能碰他\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! You do not touch him!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:34.79,1:03:36.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他是我朋友 - 你怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is my friend. - What's wrong with you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:36.12,1:03:38.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他打了三份工就为了养家糊口 - 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He works three jobs just so that he can support his family.- Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:38.65,1:03:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 怎么了 - 我们要走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- what's going on? - We're leaving.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:40.05,1:03:41.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「我们」 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "We"? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:41.08,1:03:43.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在说什么「我们」？- 离我远点\N{\fnArial\fs30}- What are you talking about, "we"? - Just stay back!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:45.27,1:03:46.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:52.82,1:03:54.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:54.35,1:03:55.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想上去吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want up?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:03:59.12,1:04:00.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,你怎么不直接说呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, why didn't you just say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:13.76,1:04:15.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面可真安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is peaceful up here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:15.79,1:04:17.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的有点恐高\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not very good with heights.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:18.09,1:04:21.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们的星球也没那么丑陋嘛\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your world is not so ugly after all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:22.27,1:04:24.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,可惜它就要被毁灭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm almost sorry to see it end.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:24.86,1:04:26.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:34.40,1:04:36.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,你去哪儿了 你去哪儿了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where'd you go? Where did you go?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:46.88,1:04:48.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,有我在呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:54.76,1:04:56.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,又来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Again?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:56.61,1:04:58.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're gonna get me killed.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:04:58.56,1:05:00.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,你死了 我也会死\N{\fnArial\fs30}You die, I die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:00.60,1:05:03.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,对啊 但只要你想 你随时都能丢掉我的身体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, well, you can always just shed my carcass{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:03.10,1:05:05.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后换上一个其他人的\N{\fnArial\fs30}and exchange it for another one whenever you need.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:05.60,1:05:07.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,我为什么要那么做\N{\fnArial\fs30}Why would I do that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:07.26,1:05:10.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的身体很好用 现在扔掉可惜了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are far too good of a match to throw away so soon.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:10.39,1:05:12.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,另外 我开始喜欢你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Plus, I am starting to like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:12.56,1:05:14.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,你我之间也没那么大的区别\N{\fnArial\fs30}You and I are not so different.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:14.74,1:05:15.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:20.12,1:05:21.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:22.95,1:05:24.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要的证据在这儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Here's your evidence.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:27.91,1:05:29.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,跳吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Jump.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.93,1:05:33.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,怂货\N{\fnArial\fs30}Pussy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:43.47,1:05:44.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,举起手来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hands!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:46.61,1:05:48.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,趴到地上 快\N{\fnArial\fs30}On the ground! Now!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:52.78,1:05:55.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,各位 你们这样做会后悔的 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Guys, you do not want to do this. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:55.68,1:05:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 面罩 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mask! - Copy!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:05:57.65,1:05:59.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 随便你们了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, have it your own way.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:00.05,1:06:01.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 面罩 - 收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Mask! - Copy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:01.85,1:06:03.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell is that thing?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:09.12,1:06:10.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,他还没死\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's not going down!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:11.52,1:06:12.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,停火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hold your fire!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:13.03,1:06:14.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪光弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flares!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:15.24,1:06:16.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那 在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's there! He's there!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.33,1:06:17.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,装弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Reload!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:18.76,1:06:20.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Anybody see him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:31.17,1:06:33.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人看到他了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anyone have eyes on him?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:34.47,1:06:37.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,切换到热成像 搜索目标中\N{\fnArial\fs30}Switching to thermal. Seeking target.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:50.77,1:06:52.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我看不到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't have eyes on him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:06:54.02,1:06:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在哪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:02.16,1:07:03.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪光弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:04.37,1:07:05.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,快扔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Throw them!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:05.78,1:07:07.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪光弹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Flash grenade!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:18.09,1:07:19.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在屋顶\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's in the rafters!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:19.53,1:07:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,上面\N{\fnArial\fs30}Above!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:26.08,1:07:27.37,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在那\N{\fnArial\fs30}There he is!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:07:31.76,1:07:33.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,闪开 快闪开\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move, move, move!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:02.94,1:08:04.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我们不能吃警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! We do not eat policemen!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:11.59,1:08:12.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮 安妮 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie! Annie, wait!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:12.83,1:08:14.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求你了 别走 - 那是什么鬼东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait, please. - Oh, what the hell is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:14.82,1:08:16.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,那不是我 我被感染了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not me. I've been infected.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:16.93,1:08:19.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 到底怎么回事 - 他在我体内\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie, what's happening? - He's inside me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:19.63,1:08:20.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 「他」 - 是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- "He"? - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:20.97,1:08:22.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我知道这听起来很疯狂 但…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know it sounds crazy, but…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:22.79,1:08:23.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,你生病了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're sick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:23.86,1:08:26.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 埃迪 你真的病了 - 不 我好害怕\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Eddie, you're really sick. - No, I am scared!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:28.90,1:08:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要帮助\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I need help.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:30.50,1:08:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,去医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hospital.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:35.52,1:08:36.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在就去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:39.31,1:08:42.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不能跟你一起去 太危险了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can't go with you. It's not safe.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:42.33,1:08:43.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,上车 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in the car, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:45.42,1:08:47.63,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 坐后面去 - 我喜欢她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- In the back. - I like her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:47.80,1:08:48.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,快上车\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:55.56,1:08:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经失控了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm out of control.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:08:59.20,1:09:00.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,让丹再给你做个核磁共振\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan just needs to do another MRI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:00.94,1:09:03.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不做核磁共振 - 不 不做核磁共振\N{\fnArial\fs30}- No MRI. - No. No. No MRI.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:03.59,1:09:04.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 为什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What? Why?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:04.55,1:09:07.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,四千到六千赫兹的声音能要了我的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound at 4, 000 to 6, 000 hertz is lethal.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:08.56,1:09:12.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,核磁共振的声频会对他造成很大的伤害\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sound frequency in the MRI is really harmful for him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:12.64,1:09:15.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么 他怕声音 就像超人害怕氪石那样吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, so, sound is like his kryptonite?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:15.44,1:09:17.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不是所有的声音 - 还有火\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Not all sounds. - And fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:18.08,1:09:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,火 他还怕火\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fire. And fire.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:19.82,1:09:21.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,他在跟你说话吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's talking to you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:22.80,1:09:24.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,从没停过\N{\fnArial\fs30}Always.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:25.42,1:09:27.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你疼吗 - 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Are you in pain? - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:27.57,1:09:30.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,实际上并没有什么感觉 只是觉得…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't feel anything, actually, apart from…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:30.14,1:09:31.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,只是一直觉得很饿\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm hungry all the time.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:32.04,1:09:34.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,也觉得很伤心 不是吗 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you feel sad, do you not, Eddie, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:34.93,1:09:36.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,当你跟她在一起时\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you are with her?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:36.98,1:09:38.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,从我脑子里滚出去 伙计\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get out of my head, man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:38.94,1:09:41.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,你从没道歉过\N{\fnArial\fs30}You never apologized.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:41.32,1:09:44.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,错过这次机会 可能就没下次了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You might not live to get another chance.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:49.87,1:09:51.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:51.68,1:09:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我只是想说 不论发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just want to say that whatever happens, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:09:55.27,1:10:01.17,Default,0,0,0,0,,我都真的 为我对你所做的一切 感到很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}that I am truly sorry for whatever… And everything I have ever done to you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:01.26,1:10:03.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I am truly, truly sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:04.17,1:10:06.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,还有 我爱你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that I love you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:07.19,1:10:08.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Eddie…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:09.63,1:10:12.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在真不是说这个的时候 先去医院 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now's really not the time. Let's just keep you alive, okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:14.26,1:10:15.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,她可真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aw, that's nice.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:18.32,1:10:23.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,我现在又湿又冷 我能穿下这个吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, I'm really wet and cold. Can I, uh, wear this?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:23.33,1:10:26.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以 你想穿什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, yeah, you can wear whatever you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:26.55,1:10:27.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:46.20,1:10:47.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,有人吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hello?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:10:58.47,1:11:00.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,你在这儿做什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you doing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:03.65,1:11:04.78,Default,0,0,0,0,,你迷路了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you lost?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:06.80,1:11:08.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没有迷路\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not lost.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:16.36,1:11:17.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for coming in.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:17.88,1:11:19.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 我很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:19.30,1:11:20.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么了\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:21.30,1:11:22.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 我拿到了你的检验报告\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I got your labs back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:22.81,1:11:24.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,你的心脏已经严重衰竭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and your heart has atrophied severely.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:24.29,1:11:26.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要听他的话 我能治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do not listen to him. I can fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:26.78,1:11:28.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不想让你来治我\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't want you to fix it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:28.32,1:11:29.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能治好你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can heal you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:31.92,1:11:33.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,你能治吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can you fix it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:33.74,1:11:35.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能 我从来没见过这样的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. I've never seen anything like this before.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:35.42,1:11:37.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 这个寄生虫 不管它是什么 - 「寄生虫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}- This parasite, whatever this is… - "Parasite"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:37.77,1:11:40.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 它在你体内吃着你的内脏 - 不是寄生虫 他不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's eating you from the inside. - Not a parasite. He's not.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:40.40,1:11:42.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你在不断掏空他 - 不 她错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You're using him up. - No. She is wrong.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:42.76,1:11:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们要带你去重症监护室 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We need to get you to the ICU. - Wait. Shh!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:45.52,1:11:48.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我 埃迪 我要死了吗 - 不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I, Eddie, am I dying? - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:48.36,1:11:49.40,Default,0,0,0,0,,你会害死他的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're killing him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:49.44,1:11:51.27,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们根本不明白这是怎么回事儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}They do not know what they are talking about.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:51.33,1:11:52.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,听着 我们没有多少时间了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Listen, we don't have a lot of time…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:52.82,1:11:55.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 我们赶紧离开这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, God! - We have to get out of here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:55.60,1:11:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 住手 - 天啊 他要杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Stop! - Oh, God, he's killing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:11:56.66,1:11:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,是我要杀你 真的很抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm killing you. I'm so sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:00.55,1:12:02.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 别开那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Don't do that!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:18.80,1:12:19.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,你还好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:19.84,1:12:21.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 抱歉 我必须把他赶出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, I'm sorry. I had to get him out of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:21.99,1:12:23.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What is that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:30.05,1:12:32.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想杀了我吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were killing me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:33.11,1:12:36.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,现在你再说「我们」 你再说\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to "we, " man? What happened to "we"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:38.11,1:12:40.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 看看你现在的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, look at you now, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:40.46,1:12:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在也快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now you're dying, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:43.85,1:12:45.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们完了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:47.16,1:12:49.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你现在要去哪 - 只要不是这里都好\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where do you think you're going? - Anywhere other than here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:49.82,1:12:51.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你不觉得我们还有点问题吗 - 等等\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You don't think we have a little problem on our hands? - Wait, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:51.28,1:12:53.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不是要把这东西留在这吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}you're not gonna leave me here with this thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:56.26,1:12:57.97,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要告诉我这到底是怎么回事吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You want to tell me what the hell's going on?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:12:58.03,1:13:00.03,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会的 你说得对\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do. And you're right.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:00.08,1:13:01.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们确实需要聊聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}We do need to talk about it, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:01.98,1:13:04.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我知道的也不比你多\N{\fnArial\fs30}but I don't know much more than you do.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:04.30,1:13:07.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜他应该是找不到别人帮忙了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess he had no one else to turn to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:07.18,1:13:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,他真让人捉摸不透\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's a very complicated man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:09.50,1:13:10.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是 丹 我保证\N{\fnArial\fs30}But, Dan, I promise, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:10.96,1:13:12.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我和埃迪之间真的没什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}there's nothing going on between me and Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:12.70,1:13:14.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,我说的不是你和埃迪 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not talking about you and Eddie, Anne.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:14.86,1:13:16.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是在说那个\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm talking about that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:19.91,1:13:21.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:27.53,1:13:28.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,它去哪了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is it?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.75,1:13:57.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 埃迪…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, Eddie, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:22.91,1:14:25.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要杀就杀吧 反正我也快死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can kill me, because I'm dying anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:26.49,1:14:28.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,我才不会直接杀了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not just gonna kill you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:28.94,1:14:31.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,那样就不好玩了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wouldn't be any fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:31.25,1:14:32.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 不 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, no, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:32.97,1:14:35.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要把你的舌头从嘴里拔出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna rip your tongue out of your face.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:38.80,1:14:40.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,够了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:40.27,1:14:42.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,别弄脏我的实验室 出去 出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're bleeding all over my lab. Go. Go!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:52.82,1:14:54.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪儿 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - I don't know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:54.51,1:14:57.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,知道吗 就算我知道 也不会告诉你\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you know what? Even if I did, I wouldn't tell you anyway.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:14:57.77,1:14:59.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't trust you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:00.34,1:15:01.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,你是个疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you're insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:01.79,1:15:03.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 太伤人了 - 抱歉\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That hurts. - Sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:03.60,1:15:05.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,这事我得详细写在日记里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Long journal entry about that tonight.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:05.33,1:15:06.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,是你在犯蠢 布洛克 我没有疯\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're being dumb, Brock. I'm not insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:06.96,1:15:09.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,真正疯狂的是如今人们的生活方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's insane is the way humans choose to live today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:10.15,1:15:12.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 我们做的只有索取 索取 再索取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. All we do is take, take, take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:12.64,1:15:14.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,不能再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It can't go on.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:14.10,1:15:16.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们把这颗星球带到了毁灭的边缘\N{\fnArial\fs30}We've brought the planet to the brink of extinction.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:16.65,1:15:18.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们才是寄生虫 你就是例子\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're parasites. You're a good example.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:18.65,1:15:20.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,想想看 你就只会索取\N{\fnArial\fs30}Think about it. All you do is take.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:20.58,1:15:22.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抢走了我的共生体\N{\fnArial\fs30}You took my Symbiote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:22.70,1:15:25.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,你抨击一个想要拯救世界的伟人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You take potshots at a great man trying to get something done.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:25.55,1:15:26.80,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:27.70,1:15:30.31,Default,0,0,0,0,,你难道没从你最爱的人 最信任你的人身上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't you take from the person you loved the most, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:30.38,1:15:31.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,索取东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}who trusted you the most?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:31.82,1:15:32.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,那才是疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's insane.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:32.82,1:15:36.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,我所开创的是一个全新的世界 一个新的物种\N{\fnArial\fs30}What I've initiated is a whole new world, a new species.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:37.23,1:15:39.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,人类和共生体 结合起来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Man and Symbiote combined.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:39.73,1:15:41.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来告诉你一件事 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me tell you something, buddy. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:41.28,1:15:42.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,开诚布公的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just man-to-man.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:42.32,1:15:45.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这几天我和这种生物\N{\fnArial\fs30}Because I have spent a significant amount of time, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:45.41,1:15:48.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,一直待在一起\N{\fnArial\fs30}all right, with one of these creatures up my ass.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:48.61,1:15:49.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,这一点儿都不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not a lot of fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:49.99,1:15:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后我发现\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then I find out, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:51.62,1:15:54.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们一直以来都想要害死你\N{\fnArial\fs30}all along, that they're killing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:54.08,1:15:55.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,我最后再问你一次\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the last time I'm asking you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:55.79,1:15:58.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我的共生体在哪 - 我不知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is my Symbiote? - I have no idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:15:58.19,1:16:00.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他在哪儿 - 我的天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Where is he? - Oh, my God!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:00.80,1:16:02.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液在哪儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Venom?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:02.45,1:16:05.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我见过的最丑的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}That is the ugliest-looking thing I have ever seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:12.28,1:16:13.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 布洛克\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, Brock, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:13.92,1:16:15.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,你对我来说没用了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have no use for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:16.07,1:16:18.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,特里斯 过来收拾你的烂摊子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Treece! Come and clean up your mess.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:18.54,1:16:23.11,Default,0,0,0,0,,我去 他身体里也有一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whoa, he has one up his ass, too.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:31.20,1:16:33.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,对你的朋友们 还有其他人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Your friends, the others, the others, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:33.68,1:16:36.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,我很抱歉 我也很想让他们活下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I apologize. I tried to keep them alive.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:36.49,1:16:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们远不止这些 有上百万个\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are more of us. Millions more.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:40.04,1:16:42.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们会遵循我的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}They will follow wherever I lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:44.24,1:16:45.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们的旨意\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where we lead.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:45.99,1:16:47.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,是的 「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, "we."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:47.69,1:16:51.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,但首先 我们必须找到他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}But first, we must retrieve them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:52.37,1:16:54.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,我能搞定这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can take care of that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.90,1:17:01.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要干嘛 要走到我累死为止吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, what you gonna do, you gonna walk me to death?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:01.96,1:17:03.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:06.72,1:17:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,没了你的朋友 你就没那么硬气了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not so tough without your friend.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:13.44,1:17:15.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,你妈妈不爱你的吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did your mama not love you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:17.91,1:17:19.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:22.05,1:17:24.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我猜你当这方面的专家应该挣得不少\N{\fnArial\fs30}I guess it pays to be a specialist, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:24.51,1:17:26.46,Default,0,0,0,0,,你知道的 你杀不杀我不重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know, it doesn't matter if you kill me anyway, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:26.50,1:17:28.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为这个世界上正在发生的事情\N{\fnArial\fs30}because there's something way bigger afoot{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:28.32,1:17:29.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,比你我都重要得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}in this world than you and me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:30.16,1:17:31.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,比我重要得多\N{\fnArial\fs30}Much bigger than me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:32.43,1:17:36.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,而且块头也比你大太多 太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And it's much, much bigger than you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:39.33,1:17:40.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,报应早晚会来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Karma's a bitch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:41.12,1:17:42.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不相信报应\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't believe in karma.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:17:50.72,1:17:51.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,嗨 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hi, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:16.24,1:18:17.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:18.96,1:18:21.13,Default,0,0,0,0,,我刚把那家伙的脑袋咬下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just bit that guy's head off.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:21.39,1:18:23.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我懂 我懂 我也体验过 这并不好玩\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know, I know. I've been there, too. It's not fun.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.91,1:18:25.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克身上的是暴乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}The one with Drake is Riot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:25.95,1:18:26.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,谁是暴乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Who's Riot?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:26.72,1:18:29.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,暴乱就是你们所谓的团队领袖\N{\fnArial\fs30}Riot is what you would call a team leader.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:29.36,1:18:31.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,他有个武器库\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has an arsenal of weapons.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:31.40,1:18:32.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克也有他的共生体\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake's got his own Symbiote.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:32.76,1:18:34.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 他势不可挡 - 这下好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He is unstoppable. - Oh, great.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:34.40,1:18:36.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们必须走了 - 去哪里 我们去哪里\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We have got to go! - Go where? Where we going?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:36.98,1:18:38.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我跟你一起去 - 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Well, I'm coming with you. - No!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:38.56,1:18:39.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,场面会很难看\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's going to get ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:39.87,1:18:41.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,她也能打得很凶残 相信我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, she can fight ugly. Trust me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:41.43,1:18:42.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 我可凶残了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I can fight ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:44.26,1:18:45.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,今天不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not today.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:47.26,1:18:49.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,简直胡扯\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that's bullshit!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:50.90,1:18:52.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,这次不是模拟发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is not a simulation.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:52.78,1:18:54.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,飞行队还没准备好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, the flight team aren't prepped yet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:54.92,1:18:57.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我来驾驶飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'll be piloting the spacecraft.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:57.37,1:18:59.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你 - 没错 我\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You? - Yes, me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:18:59.12,1:19:00.00,Default,0,0,0,0,,还要多久\N{\fnArial\fs30}How long?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:00.11,1:19:02.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们正在加载探测器以及运行诊断程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're loading the probe and running diagnostics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:02.31,1:19:03.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过 就算是全自动化的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But even fully automated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:03.74,1:19:05.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,你也不能独自驾驶飞船\N{\fnArial\fs30}you can't pilot that craft all alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:08.04,1:19:09.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我不是一个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not alone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:13.60,1:19:15.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死 刚刚发生了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}God damn it! What the hell happened there?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:15.33,1:19:17.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我们丢下了安妮 - 这对她来说不安全\N{\fnArial\fs30}- We just left Annie. - It is not safe for her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:18.12,1:19:19.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果我们不阻止暴乱\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we do not stop Riot, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:19.78,1:19:23.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,他会带着数以百万计的我的同类回到地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}he will come back here with millions more of my kind.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:23.18,1:19:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,数百万\N{\fnArial\fs30}Millions?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:24.32,1:19:27.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,怎么 你们要开走那艘火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}What, you were gonna take the rocket, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:27.52,1:19:29.67,Default,0,0,0,0,,再带着军队回来入侵地球吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you were gonna come back here with an invasion force?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:29.72,1:19:31.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后你们打算做什么 你们要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then what were you gonna do, you were gonna go{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:31.14,1:19:33.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 吞噬整个星球 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- feed on a whole planet? - Yes!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:33.30,1:19:35.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,但现在不同了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it is different now, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:35.51,1:19:37.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我已经决定留下来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have decided to stay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:38.08,1:19:41.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我的星球上 我也是个失败者 像你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}On my planet, I am kind of a loser, like you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:41.12,1:19:43.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 但在这里 我们可以变得更强 - 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}- But here, we could be more. - Excuse me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:43.78,1:19:45.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,我开始喜欢这里了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm getting to like it here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:45.70,1:19:47.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你现在喜欢我们了 是吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, you like us now, do you, huh?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:47.43,1:19:49.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,但如果我们不阻止那个火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}However, there will be nothing left to like{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:49.26,1:19:50.87,Default,0,0,0,0,,就没东西让我喜欢的了\N{\fnArial\fs30}if we do not stop that rocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:50.99,1:19:52.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,我明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, I see.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:52.13,1:19:54.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,在灭顶之灾到来的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. When it comes to being completely annihilated, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:54.74,1:19:56.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,就又是「我们」了\N{\fnArial\fs30}then it's back to "we."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:56.14,1:19:57.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,的确是「我们」\N{\fnArial\fs30}It is "we."{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:57.13,1:19:59.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管你是否愿意 我们都会遭殃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Like it or not, it is going to take both of us.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:19:59.87,1:20:01.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,行了 别扯淡了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, come on, man. Cut the bullshit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:01.10,1:20:02.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,是什么让你改变主意的\N{\fnArial\fs30}What really made you change your mind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:06.32,1:20:07.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,你\N{\fnArial\fs30}You.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:07.86,1:20:09.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,因为你 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}You did, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:11.26,1:20:13.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,不要再检测了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Scrub diagnostics.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:13.81,1:20:16.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 先生 - 你听不懂吗 启动发射程序\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Sir? - Did you hear me? Initiate the launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:22.97,1:20:25.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射倒计时五分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus five minutes to launch.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:26.01,1:20:28.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,自动化进程已启动\N{\fnArial\fs30}Auto sequence has been initiated.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:41.39,1:20:42.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:20:52.07,1:20:55.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射倒计时四分钟三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus four minutes, 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:02.64,1:21:06.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 你能对付那家伙的 对吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, Jesus! You can take this guy, right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:06.24,1:21:08.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,你根本没见识过他有多厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}He has got shit you have never seen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:08.92,1:21:10.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么意思 我们有多少胜算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What does that mean? What are our chances?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:10.96,1:21:14.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,四舍五入一下 基本为零\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hmm. Pretty much zero.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:14.65,1:21:17.53,Default,0,0,0,0,,不管了 我们去拯救地球\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, fuck it. Well, let's go save the planet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:20.46,1:21:22.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时四分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus four minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:26.17,1:21:29.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,开始读取轨道飞行器配置文件\N{\fnArial\fs30}Initiate orbiter aerosurface profile.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:32.22,1:21:34.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液 上火箭\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venom. Get in the rocket.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:35.03,1:21:39.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不会让你摧毁这个世界\N{\fnArial\fs30}No. We won't let you destroy this world.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:39.25,1:21:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,那就去死吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then die.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:51.23,1:21:53.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 天啊 - 跟你说了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Holy shit! - Told you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:21:53.52,1:21:55.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时三分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus three minutes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:07.34,1:22:09.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,你有一个强壮的宿主\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have a strong host.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:11.23,1:22:12.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,但还是不够强壮\N{\fnArial\fs30}But not strong enough.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:51.24,1:22:54.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时两分钟三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus two minutes, 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:22:56.24,1:22:57.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:23:01.87,1:23:03.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,德雷克 住手\N{\fnArial\fs30}Drake, stop!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:09.43,1:24:11.79,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟你说了 我也能大杀特杀\N{\fnArial\fs30}Told you I could fight ugly.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:18.95,1:24:21.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时一分钟\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus one minute.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:39.46,1:24:40.92,Default,0,0,0,0,,你太迟了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're too late.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:41.05,1:24:42.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是下一个阶段…\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is the next stage…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:45.19,1:24:46.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,你话太多了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You talk too much.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:56.22,1:24:57.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,倒计时 三十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}T-minus 30 seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:24:57.93,1:25:00.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你什么都不是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are nothing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:28.10,1:25:29.60,Default,0,0,0,0,,十秒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Ten seconds.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:30.42,1:25:31.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,九…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nine…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:32.33,1:25:33.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,八…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eight…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:34.34,1:25:35.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,七…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Seven…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:36.08,1:25:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,六…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Six…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:37.67,1:25:38.57,Default,0,0,0,0,,五…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Five…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:39.64,1:25:40.90,Default,0,0,0,0,,四…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Four…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:41.30,1:25:42.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,三…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Three…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:42.63,1:25:44.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,二…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Two…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:44.43,1:25:46.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,一…\N{\fnArial\fs30}One…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:48.36,1:25:49.55,Default,0,0,0,0,,发射\N{\fnArial\fs30}Liftoff.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:57.01,1:25:58.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,叛徒\N{\fnArial\fs30}Traitor!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:25:58.36,1:26:00.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,祝你生活愉快\N{\fnArial\fs30}Have a nice life.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:26.67,1:26:28.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,再见了 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Goodbye, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:26:29.26,1:26:31.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液 不\N{\fnArial\fs30}Venom, no!{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:18.73,1:27:22.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,谢谢你没放弃我 安妮 谢谢你救了我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thanks for sticking by me, Annie. Thanks for saving me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:22.57,1:27:24.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,所以 经历了这些之后你感觉如何\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, how you feeling after all that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:24.30,1:27:26.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,好极了 很棒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I feel great. Awesome.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:27.28,1:27:29.84,Default,0,0,0,0,,不过我在考虑起诉 你想帮我打官司吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah, I'm thinking of suing, though. You want to prosecute?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:30.43,1:27:33.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,你运气真好 我决定无偿工作了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're in luck. I've decided to work pro bono.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:33.41,1:27:35.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,我要去做公设辩护律师了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm joining the public defenders' office.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:35.36,1:27:37.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,你人真好 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a good person, Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:37.35,1:27:38.71,Default,0,0,0,0,,你呢 你今后有什么打算\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you? What are you gonna do?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:38.93,1:27:40.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,电视台让我回去继续做节目\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, the network asked me to bring the show back, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:40.89,1:27:42.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们想从德雷克的事开始\N{\fnArial\fs30}and they want to start with a piece on Drake.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:43.32,1:27:45.04,Default,0,0,0,0,,真的吗 你怎么回复他们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, wow, really? So, what did you say?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:45.22,1:27:46.88,Default,0,0,0,0,,我没多大兴趣\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, I'm not into it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:46.99,1:27:49.15,Default,0,0,0,0,,我想专心写几篇稿子\N{\fnArial\fs30}I want to concentrate on the written word.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:49.26,1:27:51.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,我找好了一位特别好的采访对象\N{\fnArial\fs30}I scored the interview of a lifetime.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:51.46,1:27:53.82,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是吗 谁 - 你看了就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Oh, yeah? Who? - You're gonna have to read it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:54.46,1:27:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我还得自己买报纸啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh! Like everyone else.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:56.32,1:27:57.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:27:59.91,1:28:01.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,毒液的事我很遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, I'm sorry about Venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:03.89,1:28:05.20,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿…\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, um…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:07.62,1:28:09.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,你想谈谈那个吻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you want to talk about that kiss?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:10.06,1:28:11.75,Default,0,0,0,0,,那个 那也算吻吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, that? You call that a kiss…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:11.80,1:28:13.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 那是…\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, that was…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:14.85,1:28:18.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,那是毒液的意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}Uh, that was your buddy's idea.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:18.22,1:28:20.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,这样啊 好吧 这下清楚了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, right. Well, that is good to know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:22.92,1:28:24.70,Default,0,0,0,0,,但感觉还是挺不错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It did feel kind of great, though.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:24.79,1:28:25.96,Default,0,0,0,0,,什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}What?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:26.23,1:28:27.12,Default,0,0,0,0,,我是说 那种…\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, the…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:27.20,1:28:28.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那种力量吗 - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- The power? - Yeah.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:29.20,1:28:30.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,当它 你懂的…\N{\fnArial\fs30}When it's, you know…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:30.83,1:28:32.51,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 在你体内的时候 - 我不是这意思\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Inside you? - You know what I mean.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:32.52,1:28:33.69,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:35.05,1:28:36.32,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:36.40,1:28:38.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们还是不要告诉丹这件事情 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna tell Dan about this. Okay?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:38.74,1:28:42.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,看看她 她完全不知道我们想把她追回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at her. She has no idea we are going to get her back.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:42.36,1:28:45.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,不 我不这样认为\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, I don't think so.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:45.58,1:28:46.89,Default,0,0,0,0,,抱歉 你说什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, what was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:46.99,1:28:48.08,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会告诉丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not gonna tell Dan.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:48.16,1:28:49.65,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你有什么话想对我说吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, is there something you want to tell me?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:49.72,1:28:52.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 没有 - 你注定要和我们在一起 安妮\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Nope. - You belong with us, Annie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:52.33,1:28:53.86,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 你确定吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie, are you sure?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:54.64,1:28:55.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,上帝啊 看看这个\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good Lord, look at that.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:56.03,1:28:58.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,看现在都几点了 我该走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Look at the time. I have to go.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:28:59.76,1:29:01.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,见到你真好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, it's nice seeing you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:01.47,1:29:04.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 是啊 - 照顾好自己 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah. - You take care, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:04.32,1:29:06.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 好的 你也保重 - 再见\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Yeah, you take care of yourself. - Bye.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:10.16,1:29:13.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 别就这么放弃她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey. Don't give up on her.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:13.53,1:29:15.06,Default,0,0,0,0,,你们两个都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Either of you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:15.33,1:29:16.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们不会的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We won't.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:16.46,1:29:17.95,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那个老头是谁 - 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who is that guy? - Okay.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:18.01,1:29:20.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,等等 这玩意看着很美味\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait. This thing looks delicious.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:20.95,1:29:23.74,Default,0,0,0,0,,我一点都不介意你留下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have absolutely no problem with you sticking around, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:23.79,1:29:26.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,但既然你要长住 我们就得立些规矩了 好吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but if you do, we're gonna have to have some ground rules, all right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:26.73,1:29:30.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,你不能动不动就开杀戒 想吃人就吃人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You cannot just go around eating anybody that you want to.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:30.42,1:29:32.24,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 不能吃人吗 - 对 不能\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I cannot? - No, you cannot.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:32.29,1:29:34.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,好了 我们得… 我们得反复重申这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right, we need to… We need to reiterate this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:34.27,1:29:37.58,Default,0,0,0,0,,这世上有很多好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}There are good people in this world, a lot of them.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:37.63,1:29:39.98,Default,0,0,0,0,,当然也有不少坏人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then there are bad people.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:40.07,1:29:41.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,你得学会辨别他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have to tell the difference.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:41.48,1:29:45.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,规矩是 你只能接触\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal is, you will only ever be allowed to touch, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:45.54,1:29:48.85,Default,0,0,0,0,,伤害或是 有可能 有很大的可能\N{\fnArial\fs30}harm, hurt, possibly, very possibly, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:49.06,1:29:51.54,Default,0,0,0,0,,吃掉那些非常非常坏的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}eat very, very bad people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:51.59,1:29:54.14,Default,0,0,0,0,,但是永远不能碰好人 明白吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}but never, ever, ever good people. All right?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:54.23,1:29:55.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:55.62,1:29:56.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}Good.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:56.82,1:29:58.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,但我要怎么辨别他们呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}But how does one tell the difference?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:58.38,1:29:59.38,Default,0,0,0,0,,这太简单了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, it's super simple.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:29:59.44,1:30:03.30,Default,0,0,0,0,,你只要… 你可以凭直觉 你可以意识到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, you just have to… You can intuit it, you can sense it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:03.36,1:30:05.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,有时候你甚至能感受出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sometimes you can even feel it.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:05.59,1:30:06.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,随你怎么说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Whatever you say.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:07.04,1:30:08.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们现在能去吃点东西吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}But can we get something to eat now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:08.90,1:30:14.05,Default,0,0,0,0,,不然的话 你的肝脏现在看着真是鲜嫩多汁\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, your liver, it's starting to look really, really good and juicy.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:14.11,1:30:17.18,Default,0,0,0,0,,好的 没问题 我知道这附近有个好地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Definitely. I know a place down here.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:19.53,1:30:21.02,Default,0,0,0,0,,你好 陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Mrs. C.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:21.77,1:30:23.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,最近好吗 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}How you doing, Eddie?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:23.15,1:30:24.94,Default,0,0,0,0,,跟以前一样 没什么变化 你懂的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Aingt nothing changed but the weather. You know.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:25.06,1:30:26.28,Default,0,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:28.01,1:30:31.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,那么 今晚您想吃什么宵夜呢\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what culinary delights will tickle the pickle tonight?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:31.36,1:30:33.22,Default,0,0,0,0,,炸薯球 还有巧克力\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tater tots and chocolate.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:33.29,1:30:35.19,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 可以 没问题\N{\fnArial\fs30}Right. Okay, no problem.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:35.99,1:30:37.73,Default,0,0,0,0,,该给钱了 陈\N{\fnArial\fs30}The payment's due, Chen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:39.16,1:30:41.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,求你了 我不能再这样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please. I can't keep doing this.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:41.46,1:30:42.52,Default,0,0,0,0,,快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:42.64,1:30:44.56,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 那是个坏人 对吗 - 对\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Bad guy, right? - Yep.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:51.68,1:30:53.72,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是再敢来这家店\N{\fnArial\fs30}You come in here again…{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:53.86,1:30:56.66,Default,0,0,0,0,,不对 你要是再在这个城市的任何地方\N{\fnArial\fs30}In fact, you go anywhere in this city, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:56.72,1:30:58.64,Default,0,0,0,0,,欺负无辜的市民\N{\fnArial\fs30}preying on innocent people, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:30:58.70,1:31:00.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们会找到你\N{\fnArial\fs30}and we will find you{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:00.24,1:31:02.10,Default,0,0,0,0,,然后吃掉你的两只胳膊\N{\fnArial\fs30}and eat both your arms{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:02.16,1:31:03.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 还有你的两条腿 - 不 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and then both of your legs. - No, no.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:03.46,1:31:05.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,再把你的脸从脑袋上咬下来\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then we will eat your face right off your head.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:05.63,1:31:06.81,Default,0,0,0,0,,你明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you understand?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:07.18,1:31:08.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 求求你… - 没错\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please… - Yes.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:08.32,1:31:11.23,Default,0,0,0,0,,到时候你就会变成一个没胳膊没腿\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you will be this armless, legless, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:11.27,1:31:12.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,没脸的东西 懂吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}faceless thing, won't you, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:12.90,1:31:17.36,Default,0,0,0,0,,滚在街上 就像风中的一坨屎\N{\fnArial\fs30}rolling down the street, like a turd in the wind?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:17.69,1:31:20.16,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你明白了吗 - 你到底是个什么东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Do you feel me? - What the hell are you?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:21.91,1:31:24.47,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们是毒液\N{\fnArial\fs30}We are Venom.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:26.11,1:31:28.21,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 我改主意了… - 求你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- On second thought… - Please.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:35.36,1:31:37.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,埃迪 那是什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eddie? What was that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:38.60,1:31:40.48,Default,0,0,0,0,,我长了个寄生虫\N{\fnArial\fs30}I have a parasite.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:40.56,1:31:43.09,Default,0,0,0,0,,就是这样 晚安 陈太太\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. Night, Mrs. Chen.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:44.22,1:31:45.33,Default,0,0,0,0,,「寄生虫」\N{\fnArial\fs30}"Parasite"?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:45.37,1:31:47.43,Default,0,0,0,0,,对 这是个爱称而已\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah. It's a term of endearment, that's all.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:47.60,1:31:49.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 道歉 - 不要\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apologize! - No.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:49.75,1:31:52.29,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 快道歉 - 好吧 好吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Apologize! - All right, fine.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:52.37,1:31:53.42,Default,0,0,0,0,,对不起\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:53.50,1:31:55.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,那你现在想做点什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, what do you want to do now?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:31:55.54,1:31:59.25,Default,0,0,0,0,,在我看来 我们想做什么都可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}The way I see it, we can do whatever we want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:26.86,1:34:28.77,Default,0,0,0,0,,我需要你保持安静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need you to stay quiet.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:28.83,1:34:31.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,这是我的事 不是我们的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is a "me" thing. It is not a "we" thing.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:31.97,1:34:32.91,Default,0,0,0,0,,明白了吗\N{\fnArial\fs30}You got that?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:32.96,1:34:35.44,Default,0,0,0,0,,好吧 但你快点\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, but make it quick.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:39.37,1:34:41.07,Default,0,0,0,0,,打开五号牢房\N{\fnArial\fs30}Open on five.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:42.46,1:34:43.76,Default,0,0,0,0,,开门\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go. Opening up.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:46.10,1:34:48.49,Default,0,0,0,0,,要我说 就不该听他的话\N{\fnArial\fs30}You ask me, they're dumb to let him call the shots.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:48.61,1:34:51.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,要是他提出来叫你采访他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Second he asked for you to interview him, {\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:51.39,1:34:52.99,Default,0,0,0,0,,我会马上叫他闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'd have shut that shit down.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:53.08,1:34:55.35,Default,0,0,0,0,,是啊 你知道联调局的德行 他们就是要利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, yeah, you know the FBI. They're just taking advantage{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:55.42,1:34:57.83,Default,0,0,0,0,,他唯一一次跟别人交流的机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}of the one and only time he'll ever speak to anyone.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:34:57.89,1:35:00.93,Default,0,0,0,0,,他们希望我能帮他们指认更多的尸体\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're hoping that I might help them identify some additional bodies.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:01.00,1:35:04.34,Default,0,0,0,0,,联调局压根不会亲自上阵\N{\fnArial\fs30}FBI don't work up close and personal with him.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:04.58,1:35:08.39,Default,0,0,0,0,,你要是不懂规矩 你就是下一具要指认的尸体了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The FBI will have to identify you, if you don't follow the rules.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:11.08,1:35:14.41,Default,0,0,0,0,,嘿 红毛 有人来看你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, Red! I got a visitor for you.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:34.30,1:35:36.50,Default,0,0,0,0,,- 你好 埃迪 - 嗨\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Hi, Eddie. - Hey.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:36.82,1:35:41.45,Default,0,0,0,0,,我们先不谈那些可怕的连环杀人的事 你不介意吧\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do you mind if we forego the whole creepy serial killer thing here?{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:41.51,1:35:42.68,Default,0,0,0,0,,好 我没意见\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sure, it's good with me.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:42.74,1:35:45.01,Default,0,0,0,0,,如果你想听 我也可以聊\N{\fnArial\fs30}I mean, I can turn it on if you want.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:45.12,1:35:47.26,Default,0,0,0,0,,我可以给你讲讲\N{\fnArial\fs30}I can talk about{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:47.60,1:35:51.62,Default,0,0,0,0,,动脉鲜血四溅产生的艺术效果\N{\fnArial\fs30}the Dadaist patterns of arterial spray.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:51.81,1:35:53.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,这点我相信\N{\fnArial\fs30}I bet you can.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:53.97,1:35:56.61,Default,0,0,0,0,,灯太暗了 我看不清你 埃迪\N{\fnArial\fs30}Tough to see you in this light, Eddie.{\r}
Dialogue: 0,1:35:57.56,1:35:58.59,Default,0,0,0,0,,过来点儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Come on over.{\r}
